<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luka</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt">Luka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa Theofilas, Mi tampi in kan lakih a cangmi thu pawl hi a ṭha thei tawpin an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An ngan tikah cuih thil a cangmi a hramthok ihsin mit in a hmutu pawl le cuih thu a simtu ih simmi vekin nganmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah kei khal in hi thuhla pawl hi a hramthok ihsin feltein ka zingzoi ṭheh zo ruangah a sangsangte in na hrangah ka ngan le a ṭha ding tiah ka ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An lo sim le an lo zirh ciami thu hi tlamtlingzet le dikzet ih na theihnak dingah hi ca hi ka ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Herod cu Judea Ram ih siangpahrang a si laiah, Abijah puithiam phun sungih a tel vemi puithiam Zekhariah a rak um. A nupi cu Elizabeth a si ih anih khal puithiam phun a si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An pahnih in Pathian mithmuh ah nuncan ṭha in an nung ih Bawipa ih daan le thupekmi pawl kha kimtein an thlun thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elizabeth cu a cin ruangah faate an nei lo; an nupa in an tarzet thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Voikhat ah Zekhariah cu nitin a hnaṭuan caan a kim ih Biakinn sungah puithiam hna a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puithiam pawl ih an thlun ṭheumi daan bangtuk in biakṭheng parih rimhmui ur dingah camcawhfung zuukin Zekhariah cu an hril. Curuangah Bawipa ih Biakinn sungah cun a vung lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Culai ahcun rimhmui ur caan a si ih senpi pawl cu Biakinn lengah thla an cam ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vancungmi pakhat cu a hnenah a rung lang ih rimhmui urnak biakṭheng vorhlam kapah a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zekhariah in a hmuh tikah a thin a phang ih a ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain vancungmi in, “Zekhariah, ṭih hlah! Pathian in na thlacamnak cu a thei zo ih na nupi Elizabeth in fapa a lo hrin ding. A hmin ah Johan na sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih na fapa a suah tikah na lung a awi ngaingai ding ih midang tampi tla an lung a awizet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah cu Bawipa ih mithmuh ah mi maksak ngaingai a si ding. Sabitti siseh, zu siseh a in lo ding. A suahthlak vete in Thlarau Thianghlim thawn a khat ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mi tampi tla Bawipa an Pathian hnenah a kirter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah a rak feh sungtu palai a si ding ih profet Elijah vekin a cakmi le hmual nei zetmi a si ding. Pale pawl ih thinlung tla an faale lamah a mer awter sal ding ih thu-ngai lomi pawl khal miding pawl ih thuruahdan lamzin ah a hruai kir sal ding. Bawipa ih hrangah Bawipa ih minung pawl a timtuah sak ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zekhariah in vancungmi hnenah, “Na sim vek in a cang ngaingai ding ti ziangtinso ka theih ding? Kei hi patar ka si zo ih ka nupi khal a tarzet zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah vancungmi in, “Kei hi Gabriel ka si. Pathian hmaiih a ding ringringtu ka si ih Amah in hi thuṭha na hnenih rung sim dingah i thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka thu simmi na zum lo khalle a tikcu a kim tikah cun ka thu simmi cu a kim ko ding. Hitiih na zum lo ruangah ṭong thei loin na um ding. Na hnenih ka thukammi a kimnak ni a thlen hlan lo kam khatte hman na ṭong thei nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih caan sung hmuahhmuah misenpi pawl in Zekhariah cu an hngak ringring ih ziangah Biakinn sungah cutik tiang lawmmam a rei a si pei tiah an khawruah a har.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Biakinn sung ihsin a ra suah tikih a ṭong thei lo kha an hmuh tikah Biakinn sungah langnak hmuhmi a nei a si, ti an thei. Kam khatte hman a ṭong thei lo ruangah a kut in a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakinn sungih a hnaṭuan tikcu a cem tikah Zekhariah cu inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tawkfang a rei tikah a nupi Elizabeth cu fa a vun ih thla nga sung cu lengah a suak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elizabeth in, “Neta bikah Bawipa in i bawm ih misenpi hmaiah ka ningzahnak cu i laksak zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elizabeth ih favun a thlaruknak ah Pathian in vancungmi Gabriel cu Galilee ram Nazareth an timi khua ah a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siangpahrang David ih tesinfa a si mi Josef thawn ṭhi aw dingih thukamnak a neimi fala hnenah thu pakhat sim dingin a thlah. Cuih fala hmin cu Mari a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vancungmi cu a hnenah a ra ih, “Na parah daihnak um ko seh! Bawipa na hnenah a um ih thlawsuahnak tampi a lo pek a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih vancungmi ih thusimmi a theih tikah Mari cu a don a har ngaingai ih a ṭongmi ih tican cu ziang a si pei tiah khawruahhar in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule vancungmi in, “Mari, ṭih hlah! Pathian mithmai ṭha na co a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Fa na vun ding ih fapa na hring ding. A hmin ah Jesuh na sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi maksak a si ding ih Cungnungbik Pathian ih Fapa tiah kawh a si ding. Amah cu Bawipa Pathian in a pu David bangtuk in siangpahrang ah a tuah ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakob tesinfa pawl ih tlunah a kumkhua in siangpahrang a si ding. A uknak cu a cem dah lo ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mari in vancungmi hnenah, “Kei cu fala him ka si. Cubangtuk cu ziangtinso a si thei ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vancungmi in, “Thlarau Thianghlim cu na hnenah a ra thleng ding ih Cungnungbik ih cahnak huham cu na parah a um ding. Curuangah na hrin dingmi fa cu fapa thianghlim a si ding ih Pathian Fapa tiah kawh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na sungkhat Elizabeth kha na thei a si lo maw? Fa a nei thei nawn lo tiah simrelmi a si naón a tarzet hnuah fa a vun ih atu-ah thlaruk a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ziangtin a si tile Pathian ih tuah thei lomi zianghman a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mari in, “Kei cu Bawipa ih salnu ka si. Na sim vek cun ka parah si ko seh,” tiah a ti. Cule vancungmi cun a fehsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Mari cu a tim a tuah ih Judea peng tlangpar khua ah zamrangte in a hung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutawk a thlen tikah Zekhariah inn ah a lut ih Elizabeth cu cibai a buk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mari ih ṭongkam cu Elizabeth in a theih vete in a pum sungih naute cu a caang. Elizabeth cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a khat ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />ringzet in, “Nang cu nunau hmuahhmuah lakah a thlawsuak bikmi nunau na si. Na hrin dingmi fa khal hi thlawsuahmi fa a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ziangah so ka Bawipa ih nu in kei vek tla hi i hung leen duh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ziangahtile na ṭong ka theih vete in ka pum sungih naute hi lungawi aipuang in a khir a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bawipa in na hnenih a simmi thu hi na parah a kim taktak ding ti na ruat ih na lungawi daan ding hi a va mak ve!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mari in, “Ka thinlung in Bawipa cu a thangṭhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian i Runtu parah ka nunnak cu a lung a kimzet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ziangahtile mi nauta a salnu hi hngilh loin i thei ringring a si. Atu thokin mi hmuahhmuah in mi thluasuak in ti ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian in ka hrangih thil maksak a tuah zo ruangah hin. Amah ih hmin cu a thianghlim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Sankhat hnu sankhat amah a a ṭihzahtu pawl cu a zaangfah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A baan thacak a hawi ih mi puarthau pawl cu an tumtahnak thawn a ṭhekdarh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Siangpahrang cakzet pawl kha, an lal tokham ihsin a ṭhum ih, mi nauta pawl a khaisaang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Rilrawngmi pawl cu thil ṭha in a cawm ih, milian pawl cu kut lawngin a kirter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Kan pupa pawl hnenih a thukamnak cu a kimter ih, a siahhlawh Israel bawm dingah a ra zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Abraham le a tesinfa pawl parah a kumkhua in zaangfah dingah a ciing ringring!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mari cu Elizabeth hnenah thla thum hrawng a um hnuah a inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Elizabeth cu a hrin nithla a kim ih fapa a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Elizabeth parih a makmi Bawipa ih zaangfahnak cu a sungkhat le innhnen pawl hmuahhmuah in an thei ih an zatein an lungawipi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Naute cu a suah hnu ni sarih ah a serhtan dingah an ra ih a pa hmin suangin Zekhariah tiah a hmin sak an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Asinain a nu in, “A si lo, a hmin cu Johan a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Annih in, “Nan sungte lakah cuvek hmin a neitu zohman an um si lo!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Cule a pa cu kutzung hmuh in an biak ih a fapa hmin sak a duhmi kha an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Zekhariah in ca ngannak cahnah a dil ih, “A hmin cu Johan a si,” tiah a ngan. An zatein an lau ih an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Cu ṭheh vete in Zekhariah ih hmur le lei cu an nung sal ih ṭong thei sal in Pathian a thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />An innhnen pawl cu an thin a phang zet; cuih thu cu Judea tlangpar ram hmuahhmuah ah a thang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Cuih thu a theitu hmuahhmuah in an thinlung ciar in an rak ngaihtuah fingfing ih, “Hi naute cu ziangbangtuk minung ah hung cang pei maw!” tiah an ti cio. Ziangahtile Bawipa ih huham cu naute parah a um ti kha a fiangin an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Johan ih pa Zekhariah cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a khat ih hiti in Pathian thu a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Israel ih Pathian Bawipa cu thangṭhat uhsi; A minung pawl bawm dingah le, luatter dingah a ra zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Kan hrangah a mak zetmi Runtu a suakter zo; Amah cu Bawipa ih siahhlawh David ih tesinfa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Khuahlan a profet thianghlim pawl sung ihsin thu in kam cia zo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />In huatu pawl kut sungin le kan ral pawl kut sung ihsin humhim dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Kan pupa pawl hnenah ‘Zaangfah thinpemnak ka nei ding ih, ka thukamnak thianghlim cu ka hngilh lo ding,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Kan pu Abraham hnenah, ‘Nan ral pawl kut ihsin ka lo run ding; ṭihnak zianghman um loin ka hna nan ṭuan ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Nan nunsung hmuahhmuah ka hmaiah mi ding le Mi thianghlim nan si ding,’ tiah siatcam in thukamnak a rak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />“Ka fa, nang cu a saang bik Pathian ih profet tiah kawh na si ding. Nang cu Bawipa ih lamzin rak sial saktu dingah a hmaiah na rak feh ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />A minung pawl cu an sual ngaidamnak in rundamnak an ngah ding a si, tiih simtu dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu mi zaangfahtu le mi nunnem a si ruangah, Rundamnak zing khawtleu cu kan parah a tlaangter ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Thimnak le thihnak phenthlam hnuai ih a ummi pawl hrangah Vancung ihsin a tlaang ding ih, remnak lamzinah in fehter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Naute cu taksa in siseh thlarau in siseh a ṭhang ih a cak vivo. Israel mi hnenah zapi hmuh ih a lang hlansung cuih ramṭhing ahcun a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih caanah Siangpahrang Augustas a um ih a ukmi Rom ramsung hmuahhmuah ah mipum siar ih hmin lak thluh dingin thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi mipum siarnak hmaisa bik caanah hin Kuirinias cu Siria ram uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah zozo khal mipum siar ih hminkhum dingah anmah ih suahnak khua ciarah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef cu Galilee ram Nazareth khua ihsin Siangpahrang David suahnak Judea ram Bethlehem khua ah a feh. Josef cu David tesinfa a si ruangah cutawk khua ih a fehnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipum siar hminkhum dingah cun ṭhit dingih a ham ciami Mari thawn an feh. Mari cu nau a pai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem khua an um laiah nau hrin tikcu a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A fatir ah fapa a hring ih puan in an tuam hnuah rannung rawl einak kuang sungah an hlum; ziangahtile riahbuk ah riahnak khaan an co lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutawk ram sungah cun tuukhal ṭhenkhat pawl cu zanah an tuu pawl kil in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi pakhat cu an hnenah a lang ih Bawipa ih sunlawinak cu an parah a rung tleu. An ṭih ngaingai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />asinain vancungmi cun, “ṭih hlah uh! Nan hrangah thuthang ṭha ka run keng; cuih thuthang ṭha cu mi hmuahhmuah hrangah lungawinak ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuih zan rori ah David khawsungah nanmah Runtu Bawi Khrih a suak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cumi hminsinnak ah hiti in a si ding: naute cu puan in an tuam ding ih rannung rawl einak kuang sungah an hlum nan hmu ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmakhatteah cuih vancungmi thawn hmun khatah vancung ihsin vancungmi burpi an rung lang ih Pathian thangṭhatnak hla an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A saang bik vanah khin Pathian cu thangṭhat si ko seh; A duhdawtmi minung pawl umnak leilungah hin remnak leeng ko seh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vancungmi cu vanih an kirsal tikah tuukhal pawl in, “Bethlehem khua ah va feh in Bawipa ih in simmi cu va zohhnik uhsi,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuticun manhlap zetin an feh ih Mari le Josef le rannung rawl einak kuang sungih a itmi naute cu an va hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuukhal pawl in naute an hmuh tikah vancungmi in cuih naute thuhla an simmi cu an hnenah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuukhal pawl ih simmi thu a theitu hmuahhmuah cu an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mari in hi thu hmuahhmuah cu ṭhazet in a ciing ringring ih thuk zetin a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule tuukhal pawl cu an kir ih an hmuhmi le an theihmi pawl ruangah Pathian thangṭhatnak hla sak phah in an tlung. Vancungmi ih a rak sim cia vekin a kim ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zarh khat hnuah naute cu a serhtan caan a kim tikah Jesuh tiah a hmin an sak. Cuih hmin cu a nuih a vun hlan ihsin vancungmi in a rak sim ciami hmin a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses daan sungih a um bangtuk in thianter awknak hrangih tuah ṭulmi pawl kha Josef le Mari in an tuah ding tikcu a thleng. Curuangah naute cu Bawipa hnenih hlan dingin Jerusalem ah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa ih daan cabu sungah, “Fatir mipa pohpoh cu Bawipa ih hnenah nan hlan pei,” tiah ngan ciami a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Bawipa ih pekmi daan sungih a um vekin thuro khuah khat a si lole laileng note pahnih thawn thawinak pe dingah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Simeon an ti mipa pakhat cu Jerusalem khua ah a rak um. Amah cu mi ṭha le Pathian a ṭihzahtu a si ih Israel mi hneemnak an ngahnak ding kha a hngak ringringtu a si. Thlarau Thianghlim a hnenah a um ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Bawipa ih tiammi Messiah na hmuh ngah hlanah cun na thi lo ding,” tiah fiangtein a phuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thlarau hruainak in Simeon cu Biakinn sungah a feh tikah daan vekin a hrangih tuah dingah Jesuh cu a nu le a pa in Biakinn sungah an ratpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Simeon in naute cu a ṭaangah a cawi ih Pathian a thangṭhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Bawipa, tuihsun ah hin na thukammi cu na kimter ih, Na salpa cu daitein a nunnak ni na liamter thei thlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na rundamnak cu ka mit rori in ka hmu zo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah mit hmuh ih na timtuahmi rundamnak cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih rundamnak cu Zentail mi hnenah na lamzin langtertu tleunak a si ih, Na minung Israel mi pawl hnenah sunlawinak thlengtertu a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Simeon ih ṭongmi cu naute nu le pa in an theih tikah an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutikah Simeon cun thlawsuah a pek hai ih a nu Mari hnenah, “Hi naute cu Israel mi lakah mi tampi tluknak dingah le mi tampi tungdingtu dingah Pathian ih hrilmi a si. Amah hi mitampi in an engtaimi le Pathian hnenin a rami hmuhsaknak mak a si ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />cutiih an relsiat ruangah anmah thinlung sungih thuthup pawl an neihmi langtertu ah a cang ding. Cule nangmah khal a hriammi ralnam ih sun vekin riahsiat ninghannak in na thinlung a lo sun ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Anna an timi nunau profet pakhat a um ih amah cu nuhmei a si ih Asher hrin Fanuel ih fanu a si. Kum sarih sung lawng pasal a nei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />amah cu kum sawmriat le kum li a si. Nitin Biakinn ah a um ih a sun a zan in Pathian a biak ih rawl-ul in thla a cam ringringtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Culaifang ah a ra thleng ve ih Pathian a thangṭhat ngaingai. Cule Pathian in Jerusalem a luatter ding a si ti ih a hngaktu pawl hmuahhmuah hnenah naute thu cu a sim ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Josef le Mari in Bawipa ih daanih a fialmi vekin tuah ṭulmi pawl an tuah ṭheh hnu ah Galilee ram Nazareth khua an inn ah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Naute cu a ṭhang vivo ih a cak ngaingai. Amah cu fimnak in a khat ih Pathian thlawsuahnak a parah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh ih nu le pa cu kumtinte Lantak Puai ah Jerusalem ah an feh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesuh kum hleihnih a kim tikah an daan vekin puai ahcun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />An puai a cem tikah inn ah an tlung, asinain nauhak pa Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah a taangta. A nu le a pa in cumi cu an thei lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />mizapi lakah a tlung ve hmang tiah an ruat. Sun nihlawh an feh hnuah an sungkhat le rualpi pawl lakah an hawl vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Asinain an hmu thotho lo; curuangah amah hawl in Jerusalem ah an kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A ni thumnak ah Biakinn sungah an hmu. Judah mi zirhtu saya pawl an tokhawm ih an thu ngai phah in thu khal a sut phah rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thu a theih daan le fim zetih a thu leh daan an hmuh tikah a theitu pawl cu an mang a bangzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A nu le a pa in cutawkih Jesuh an hmuh tikah an lau an khawruah a har ngaingai ih a nu in, “Ka fapa, ziangah so hi bangtuk hin in tuah? Na pa thawn awloksong in kan lo hawl rero!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziangah so in hawl duh rero? Ka Pa ih inn ah um ding ka si, ti nan thei lo maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Asinain cutiih a thu lehnak cu a tican an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu a nu le a pa thawn Nazareth ah an kir ih an thu ngai in a um. A nu in hi thuhla hmuahhmuah cu a thinlung ah feltein a ciing ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesuh cu taksa in siseh, fimnak in siseh a ṭhang vivo ih Pathian hmai le minung hmaiah mithmai ṭha a ngah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rom siangpahrang Tiberias ih ram a uknak kum hleinga kumah Pontius Pilat cu Judea ram uktu Mangki bawi a si ih Herod cu Galilee ram uktu a si. Cule Herod ih u Filip cu Iturea le Trakhonitis ram uktu a si; Lisanias cu Abilene ram uktu a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annas le Kaiafas cu Puithiam Saang an si. Cuih tikcu caan hrawngah ramṭhing ih um Zekhariah ih fapa Johan hnenah Pathian ṭongkam a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Johan cu Jordan Tiva kiangkap ram hmuahhmuah a tlawng vivo ih, “Nan sual sir uhla baptisma lak uh; cule Pathian in nan sualnak a lo ngaidam ding,” tiah thu a sim vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Profet Isaiah ih ṭong cu cabu sungah ngan in a um. Cuih cabu sungah: “Mi pakhat cu ramṭhing ah a au ih, ‘Bawipa ih lamzin kha rem uh, a fehnak lamzin cu ngilter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Horkuam hmuahhmuah silhkhat uhla, tlang le mual hmuahhmuah in rawnter uh; Lam kel hmuahhmuah dingter uhla, a bingbo mi hmuahhmuah in rualter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miphun zakip in Pathian ih runnak an hmu ding,’ tiah a ti,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mitampi cu Johan ih baptisma lak dingah a hnenah an ra. Johan cun, “Nannih rul pawl! A ra thleng cing dingmi Pathian ih hremnak ihsin nan luat thei ding tiah zoso a lo sim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan sualnak nan sir awk ahcun nan thil tuahmi in langter uh. Abraham kha kan pu a si pam tiah ti rero hlah uh. Fiangtein ka lo sim: Pathian in hi lungto hman hi Abraham ih tesinfa ah a cangter thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thingkung pawl a hram ihsin haunak dingah hreitlung retcia a si zo. Rahṭha a rah lomi thingkung cu an hau ding ih meisa sungah an paih ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah mipi in, “Cuti asile ziangtinso kan um ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih in, “Angki zun hnih a neitu in zun khat cu a nei lotu hnenah ṭhen seh; rawl a neitu in a nei lotu kha hlawm seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siahkhongtu ṭhenkhat pawl Johan ih baptisma lak dingah an ra ih, “Sayapa, kannih pawl ziangso kan tuah ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anih in, “Nan khon ding zat hnakih tam deuh in va la hlah uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ralkap ṭhenkhat pawl khal in, “Kannih teh? Ziangtin so kan tuah ding?” tiah an ra sut ve. An hnenah cun, “Zo ih hnen hmanin hranhram in paisa va lak hlah uh; thuphan in zohman sual va puh hlah uh. Nan thlahlawh zatah nan lungkim uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in ruahsannak an nei ciamco ih Johan cu Messiah a si pei maw, tiah an mangbangin an ruat fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah Johan in, “Kei cun tidai in baptisma ka lo pek. Asinain mi pakhat kei hnakih tum sawn a ra ding. Kei cu a kedam hri phoih saktu ding hman ka tlak lo. Anih cun Thlarau Thianghlim le meisa in baptisma a lo pek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Fang seepnak ṭangṭa a keng ih fang pawl a seep ding. Fangngai cu a cuam sungah ṭhatein a ret thluh ding, asinain a hii pawl cu a mit dah lomi meisa sungah a ur ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johan cun Thuthang ṭha cu mipi hnenah a phunphun in a sim ih an ziaza thleng dingah a forh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain Mangki bawi Herod cu a naupa ih nupi Herodias a ṭhit ih thil ṭha lo dangdang tla a tuah ruangah Johan in a kawk ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Herod in Johan cu thawngah a thlak ih cuticun thil ṭha lo sinsin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah baptisma an lak ṭheh hnuah Jesuh khal a lak ve. Thla a cam laifangah van a ong aw ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim cu a tlunah thuro bangtuk in a rung fu. Cule vancung ihsin aw a thang ih, “Nangmah cu ka duhdawtmi ka Fapa na si. Na parah ka lung a awizet,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh cu hnaṭuan a thok tikah kum sawmthum hrawng a si. Mipi in Josef fapa a si tiah an ruat. Josef cu Heli fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Heli cu Matthat fapa a si, Matthat cu Levi fapa a si, Levi cu Melkhi fapa a si, Melkhi cu Jannai fapa a si, Jannai cu Josef fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josef cu Mattathias fapa a si, Mattathias cu Amos fapa a si, Amos cu Nahum fapa a si, Nahum cu Esli fapa a si, Esli cu Naggai fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Naggai cu Maath fapa a si, Maath cu Mattathias fapa a si, Mattathias cu Semein fapa a si, Semein cu Josef fapa a si, Josef cu Joda fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joda cu Joanan fapa a si, Joanan cu Rhesa fapa a si, Rhesa cu Zerubbabel fapa a si, Jerubbabel cu Shealtiel fapa a si, Shealtiel cu Neri fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Neri cu Melkhi fapa a si, Melkhi cu Addi fapa a si, Addi cu Kosam fapa a si, Kosam cu Elmadam fapa a si, Elmadam cu Er fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Er cu Joshua fapa a si, Joshua cu Eliezer fapa a si, Eliezer cu Jorim fapa a si, Jorim cu Matthat fapa a si, Matthat cu Levi fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Levi cu Simeon fapa a si, Simeon cu Judah fapa a si, Judah cu Josef fapa a si, Josef cu Jonam fapa a si, Jonam cu Eliakim fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eliakim cu Melea fapa a si, Melea cu Menna fapa a si, Menna cu Mattatha fapa a si, Mattatha cu Nathan fapa a si, Nathan cu David fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David cu Jesse fapa a si, Jesse cu Obed fapa a si, Obed cu Boaz fapa a si, Boaz cu Salmon fapa a si, Salmon cu Nahshon fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nahshon cu Amminadab fapa a si, Amminadab cu Admin fapa a si, Admin cu Arni fapa a si, Arni cu Hezron fapa a si, Hezron cu Perez fapa a si, Perez cu Judah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah cu Jakob fapa a si, Jakob cu Isaak fapa a si, Isaak cu Abraham fapa a si, Abraham cu Terah fapa a si, Terah cu Nahor fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nahor cu Serug fapa a si, Serug cu Reu fapa a si, Reu cu Peleg fapa a si, Peleg cu Eber fapa a si, Eber cu Shelah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Shelah cu Kainan fapa a si, Kainan cu Arphaksad fapa a si, Arphaksad cu Shem fapa a si, Shem cu Noah fapa a si, Noah cu Lamek fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lamek cu Methuselah fapa a si, Methuselah cu Enok fapa a si, Enok cu Jared fapa a si, Jared cu Mahalaleel fapa a si, Mahalaleel cu Kenan fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kenan cu Enosh fapa a si, Enosh cu Seth fapa a si, Seth cu Adam fapa a si, Adam cu Pathian fapa a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu Thlarau Thianghlim thawn khat in Jordan ihsin a ra kir ih Thlarau in ramṭhing ah a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutawkah ni sawmli sung Satan in a hniksak. Cuih sung hmuahhmuah zianghman a ei lo ruangah a netnak ahcun a ril a rawng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Satan in Jesuh cu, “Pathian Fapa na si ahcun hi lungto hi sang ah cangter aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ca Thianghlim in ‘Milai nunnak hi rawl lawngin a si lo,’ a ti,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Satan in a hun fehpi ih mitṭhepkar ah leilung tlun ram hmuahhmuah a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hi leilung parih thuneihnak le lennak hmuahhmuah hi nangmah ka lo pe ding. Ka ta an si ṭheh ih ka duhmi hnenah ka pe thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hmaiah kuun in i biak ahcun a zatein na ta an si ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ca Thianghlim in ‘Bawipa na Pathian na biak pei ih Amah lawng na rian pei,’ a ti,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Satan in Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah a fehpi ih Jerusalem Biakinn zim ah a ret ih, “Pathian Fapa na si ahcun hitawk ihsin dawp aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Ca Thianghlim in, ‘Nangmah a lo kilkhawitu dingah Pathian in a vancungmi pawl a fial ding,’ a ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Ca Thianghlim sungah, ‘An kut in an lo cawi ding ih na ke lungto ah na khawng aw lo ding,’ ti khal in a um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh cun, “Ca Thianghlim in ‘Bawipa na Pathian cu va hniksak hlah,’ a ti,” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Satan in Jesuh cu a phunphun in sual a forh ṭheh hnuah caan malte sung a feh santa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh cu Galilee ah a kir ih Thlarau Thianghlim huham cu a hnenah a um. Cuih ram hmuahhmuah ah a hmin a thang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sinakok ah thu a zirh ih mi hmuahhmuah in an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh cu a rak tuallennak hmun Nazareth khua ah a feh ih amah ih daan vekin Sabbath ni ah sinakok ah a feh. Ca Thianghlim siar dingah a ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />profet Isaiah cazual kha an pek. Cuih cazual cu a pharh ih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Bawipa ih Thlarau cu ka parah a um, Ziangahtile mifarah hnenih Thuthang ṭha sim dingah hriakculh in i hril zo. Sal taangmi pawl hnenih luatnak thu sim dingah le Mitcaw in khua an hmuh thei salnak dingah i thlah. Hremmi pawl luatter dingah le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl a runnak ding tikcu a ra thleng zo, ti than dingah i thlah a si,” tiih ngannak hmun kha a siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in a siarmi cazual cu a zual sal ih a kiltu ih kutah a pek ih a to. A ra pumkhawmmi hmuahhmuah in Jesuh cu mitṭhep loin an zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule anih in, “Ka siarmi nan rak theih vekin hi Ca Thianghlim sungih nganmi cu tuihsun ah a kim a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmualnei zet ih a ṭongmi kha an theih tikah an thinlung ah a lutzet ih mak an ti ngaingai. “Hi pa hi Josef fapa a si lo maw si?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “ṭongṭhimnak ih ‘Sibawipa, nangmah le nangmah damter aw he!’ timi kha in ṭongsan ding ti fiangtein ka thei. Cuih tlunah ‘Kapernaum khua ih na tuahmi thil pawl tla na khua ah hin tuah ve aw,’ tiah in ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: Profet cu amah ih khua ah sunloih a si dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka simmi hi ngai uh: Elijah sanah kum thum le a hrek sung ruah a sur lo ih ram pumpuluk ah paampi a tlun laiah khan Israel ram sungah nuhmei an tamzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asinain cuih nuhmei pawl hnenah Elijah cu thlah a si lo; Sidon ram Zarefath khua ih nuhmei nu hnen lawngah thlah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule profet Elisha san laiah khan Israel ram sungih a ummi mitampi cu phaarnat in an na; asinain midang zohman damnak an ngah lo; Siria mi Naaman lawng a dam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cumi cu sinakok ih a ra pumkhawmmi pawl in an theih tikah an thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An zatein an pok ih Jesuh cu an khua ihsin an dirhsuak hnuah an khua ih tlangzim tiang an hruai ih khaam ihsin tuul thlak an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh cu miruul lak ihsin a feh hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun Jesuh cu Galilee peng Kapernaum khua ah a feh ih Sabbath ni ah thu a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A thuzirh zia an hmuh tikah hmualnei zetih a zirh ruangah an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih sinakok ah ramhuai ih polh mi, ramhuai thlarau neitu, pakhat a um. Cupa cu ring zetin a au ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Nazareth Jesuh, ziangti ih tuah so in duh? Kanmah siatsuah dingah maw na rat? Zo na si ti ka lo thei: Pathian tirhfung thianghlim na si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Daite in um! Hi pa sung ihsin suak aw,” tiah thu a pek. Ramhuai cun mizapi hmaiah mipa cu a thluk ih a parah zianghman siatsuahnak tuah lo tein a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutikah mipi pawl cu an mang a bang tuk lawmmam ih pakhat le pakhat, “Hi pa ih ṭongka cu a va mak so! Thu neizet le huham nei zetin ramhuai pawl tla thu a pek ih a suahter,” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Jesuh thuhla cu cuih ramsung khuazakipah a thang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh cu sinakok ihsin a suak ih Simon inn ah a feh. Simon ih pizon cu khawsiknat in a rak na ih cuih thu cu Jesuh an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu a ihkhun kiangah a ding ih a khawsiknat cu dam dingin thu a pek. Hmakhatte-ah a dam; a tho ih anmah pawl cu a tuamhlawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ni a tlak hnuah natnak phunphun a tuartu pawl cu an rualpi pawl in Jesuh hnenah an rak hruai. A nami pawl ih lu parah a kut a suan ih an natnak ihsin a damter thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mitampi sung ihsin khawsia pawl cun, “Nang cu Pathian Fapa na si!” tiah au phah in an suak. Sikhalsehla Jesuh in khawsia pawl cu ṭong lo dingin thu a pek, ziangahtile Messiah a si kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khua a hung vang ih Jesuh cu khawsung ihsin a pok ih ramṭhing ah a va feh. Mi in an hawl ciamco ih an hmuh tikah, “In fehsan hram hlah aw,” tiah an leem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Asinain an hnenah, “Pathian Uknak Thuthang ṭha cu khua dangdang khal ah ka sim a ṭul hrimhrim a si, ziangahtile cumi tuah dingah Pathian ih thlahmi ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cutiin Judea ram sungih sinakok ahcun thu a sim vivo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Voikhat ah Jesuh cu Gennesaret Tili kapah a ding ih culaiah Pathian thu a simmi ngai duh ah misenpi cun amah naih an cuh aw ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Culai ah Jesuh in titlang ih lawng pahnih an hrenmi kha a hmu. Ngakaitu pawl cu lawng sung ihsin an suak ih an sur pawl an kholh rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh cu lawng pakhat deuh sungah a lut; cuih lawng cu Simon ih ta a si; cule lawng cu titlang ihsin a hlatnak deuh ah ṭhawn dingin a fial. Cuih lawng sungah Jesuh cu a to ih misenpi pawl cu a zirh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thusim a ṭheh tikah Simon hnenah, “Ti thuknak lamah na lawng hi ṭhawn awla na rualpi pawl thawn nan sur cu vun vorhhnik uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simon in, “Bawipa, taima zetin zanvarte kan vorh naón zianghman kan awk lo. Sikhalsehla vorh uh, in ti a si ahcun kan vorh a si pei cu,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sur cu an vun vorh ih nga tam ngaingai an awk ih an sur tiangin a tlek ṭhehzik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah lawng dangih an rualpi pawl kha, “In ra bawm uh,” tiah an kut an hei zaap. An ra ih an lawng pahnih cu nga khattein an ret ih an lawng cu a pil zikte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cumi cu Simon in a hmuh tikah Jesuh ih khuk kiangah a khuk a bilh ih Jesuh hnenah cun, “Bawipa, i fehsan hram aw; ziangahtile kei hi misual ka si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah le a rualpi pawl cu nga tam ngaingai an awh ruangah an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in amah thawn nga a kaitu Zebedi ih fapa Jeim le Johan khal an mang a bang ve. Jesuh in Simon cu, “Na thin phang hlah; atu thokin minung kaitu na si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An lawng pawl cu ti kapah an dinter ih an thil hmuahhmuah fehsan in Jesuh cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Voikhat ah Jesuh cu phaarnat a tuartu pa pakhat ih umnak khua ah a thleng. Cupa cun Jesuh a hmuh tikah a hmaiah a bok ih, “Bawipa, na duh ahcun i thiangter thei a si,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesuh in a kut in a tham hnuah, “Ka lo thiangter duh, thiang thlang aw,” tiah a ti. Hmakhatteah a natnak cu a dam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zohman va sim hlah, asinain va feh vurvo awla puithiam in lo zohseh; cule na dam ti kha mi hmuahhmuah ih an lo hmuhnak dingah Moses daan vekin thawinak va pe aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh thuhla cu hmun kipah a thang sinsin, mi in an pan sinsin ih a thu simmi an ngai; cule an natnak khal a damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih hnuah misenpi hnen ihsin feh tahratin hlimphirnak hmunah amah lawng thla a cam ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nikhat ah Jesuh cu thu a zirh rero laiah Jerusalem khua le Judea ram le Galilee ramih khawkip ihsin a rami Farasi le Daanthiam ṭhenkhat pawl khal an ra to ve. Mina damter theinak Bawipa ih huham cu Jesuh parah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Culai ah mizengpa pakhat cu a ihphah thawn laangin an rak zawn ih Jesuh hmaiih vun ret dingah inn sungah luhpi an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi an tamtuk ruangah an fehpi theinak ding lamzin a um lo. Curuangah inn parah an kaipi ih diphun bauh hnuah misenpi lak Jesuh hmai rori-ah cun a ihphah thawn an vun thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zumnak an neihzia kha Jesuh in a hmuh tikah mizengpa hnenah cun, “Ka rual, na sualnak cu ngaithiam a si zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daanthiam pawl le Farasi pawl cun, “Pathian thangsiatnak hi bangtuk a ṭong theitu milai cu ziangvek milai so a si? Pathian pakhat lawng sual ngaithiam theitu a si,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesuh in an ruahmi cu a thei ih an hnenah, “Hi bangtuk in ziangah so nan ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Na sualnak hi ngaithiam a si zo,’ ti maw, a si lole ‘Tho awla feh aw,’ tiso a ol sawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi Fapa hi leilung tlunah hin sualnak a ngaithiam thei a si, ti nan hnenah ka langter ding,” tiah a ti. Cule mizengpa cu, “Ka lo sim: Tho aw! Na ihphah la awla na inn ah tlung aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmakhatteah mizengpa cu mipi hmaiah cun a tho ih a ihphah cu a lak ih Pathian thangṭhat phah in a inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mipi cu an mang a bang ngaingai! ṭih phah in Pathian cu an thangṭhat ih, “Ziangbangtuk khawruahharza thil so tuihsun ih kan hmuh mi hi!” tiah an rel ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu a feh ih siahkhongtu Levi an timi pa a zung sungih a to kha a hmu. Jesuh in a hnenah, “I thlun aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levi cu a tho ih ziang hmuahhmuah taanta in Jesuh cu a thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Levi in a inn ah rawl einak puai tumpi Jesuh hrangah a tuah ih a sawmmi pawl lakah cun siahkhongtu pawl le midang tampi an tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Farasi mi ṭhenkhat le Daanthiam ṭhenkhat anmah ih bu sungtel pawl cu Jesuh dungthluntu pawl hnenah an phunzai. “Ziangah so siahkhongtu le misual tla thawn rawl nan ei ih ti nan in tlang?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesuh in, “A harhdammi pawl in sibawi an ṭul lo, a nami pawl lawngin an ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Miding pawl ko dingah ka ra lo; misual pawl an sual sir awter dingah ka ra a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat in Jesuh hnenah, “Johan dungthluntu pawl cu rawl an ul ṭheu ih thla khal an cam ṭheu; cule Farasi pawl ih dungthluntu pawl tla in cuvekin an tuah ve ṭheu. Asinain na dungthluntu pawl cu an duhduh in an in an ei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Mopuai a ra zawhtu pawl cu mopa an hnenih a um sungah rawl loin an um ding maw?” tiah a sut. “An um lo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mopa an hnen ihsin laak a si caan a ra thleng ding ih cutikah rawl cu an ul leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh in an hnenah hiti in thuṭhimnak a sim, “Zohman in hnipuan hlun belhnak dingah hnipuan thar an thlek dah keel lo. An thlek a si ahcun hnipuan thar cu a tlek laklawh ding ih hnipuan hlunih an belh tikah a kaih aw fawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule zohman in sabitti thar cu savun thawl hlun sungah an thun lo ding, ziangahtile sabitti thar in thawl hlun cu a pahkuai ding ih sabitti cu a bung lak ding ih thawl khal cu a siat ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cu hnak cun sabitti thar kha savun thawl thar sungah thun sawn ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cun sabitti hlun an in hnuah zohman in sabitti thar an in duh lo. ‘A hlunmi a ṭha sawn,’ an ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu Sabbath ni ah lo lakin a feh. A dungthlun pawl in sangvut vui an zuut phah ih an zaphak sungih an nuai hnuah a fang cu an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farasi mi ṭhenkhat pawl in, “Kan Daan in Sabbath ni ah tuah lo ding, timi cu ziangah so nan tuah?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “David le a ralkap pawl an ril a rawn tikah David in ziang a tuah ti kha nan siar dah lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian inn sungah lut tahratin Pathian hnenih pekmi sang a lak ih a ei; cule a ralkap pawl tla a pek a si. Puithiam pawl siar lo cuih saang ei cu kan Daan in a duh lo a si kha!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a netnak ah, “Milai Fapa cu Sabbath ih Bawi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Voikhat ah Sabbath ni ah Jesuh cu sinakok ah a feh ih thu a zirh. Cunah cun a kut vorhlam a zengmi pa pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Farasi mi ṭhenkhat pawl le Daanthiam ṭhenkhat pawl in Jesuh ih sual hawl an duh ruangah Sabbath ni ahhin a damter pei maw, tiah cat loin an zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ruahnak cu Jesuh in a theih ruangah mipa cu, “Tho awla hmailam ahhin ra suak aw,” tiah a ti. Kutzeng pa cu a tho ih hmaiah cun a ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in an hnenah, “Thu ka lo sut hai ding: Kan Daan in Sabbath ni ih tuah dingah ziangso in on? Mi bom ding maw, mi tuahmawh ding so? Mi nunnak humhim ding maw, siatsuah ding so?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule cu pawl cu a zohhliah vivo hnuah kutzeng pa hnenah cun, “Na kut hawi aw,” a ti. A kut cu a hawi ngaingai ih a dam ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farasi le Daanthiam pawl cu an thin a heng tuk ih Jesuh an siatsuah theinak dingah thu an ron aw ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Culai ah Jesuh cu thlacam dingin tlang parah a kai ih Pathian hnenah zanvar thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua a hung vaan tikah a dungthlun pawl a ko khawm ih anmah sungin mi hleihnih a hril; cupawl cu ‘Tirhthlah pawl’ tiah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An hmin cu Simon (Piter tiah a kawhmi) le a nau Andru, Jeim le Johan, Filip le Bartholomeo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Matthai le Thomas, Alfias ih fapa Jeim le Simon (Phunṭantu tiih kawhmi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeim ih fapa Judas le Jesuh phiar lehtu Judas Iskariot tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh cu a dungthlun pawl thawn tlangpar ihsin an rung suk ih a thluntu tampi pawl thawn hmun rawn ah an ding. Mitampi cutawkah cun an ra; Judea ram pumpuluk ihsin siseh, Jerusalem khua in siseh, tipikap ih a ummi Taiar le Sidon khawpi tla in an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesuh thusimmi ngai duh ah le an natnak tla dam duh ah an ra. Thlarau thiang lo pawl ih zonzaihtermi pawl tla a damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in amah kha tham an duh; ziangahtile a sung ihsin huham a suak ih a damter ṭheh hai ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl a zoh hai ih, “Mi farah pawl cu mi thlawsuak nan si, Pathian Uknak cu nanmah ih ta a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Atu laiih rilrawng pawl cu mi thlawsuak nan si, nan khopkham leh ding a si! “Atu laiih mitthli a tlami pawl cu mi thlawsuak nan si, nan lungawiin nan hni leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi in an lo hua, an lo hnong ih Milai Fapa ruangah an lo hmuhsuam, an lo relsiat asile mi thlawsuak nan si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cubangtuk a si tikah nan thin nuam in um uhla lungawiin laam uh; ziangahtile nan hrangah tuarman tampi vancungah retcia in a um zo. Cubangtuk cu an pupa pawl khal in profet pawl parah an rak tuah zomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Atuih milian pawl cu zaangfakza nan si; nunnuam nan comi a cem zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Atuih a khopkham pawl cu zaangfakza nan si; rilrawngin nan vakvai leh ding. “Atuih a hni rero pawl cu zaangfakza nan si; nan ṭap nan ai leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mikip ih porh le fakmi cu zaangfakza nan si; Ziangahtile an pupa pawl khal in cuvekin profet deu pawl kha an rak porh dah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla ka thu a theitu nannih pawl: Nan ral duhdaw uh; a lo huatu pawl parah ṭhatnak tuah uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a lo camtu pawl khi thlawsuah pe uhla a lo hremtu pawl hrangah thla cam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat in na biang a lo beng asile khatlam khal tun hrih aw; mi pakhatkhat in na kawt angki lenghruk a lak ahcun na angki sunghruk khal pe cih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na thilri pakhatkhat a lo diltu an um ahcun va pe aw; cule mi pakhatkhat in na thil an lak le va dil sal nawn hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na hrangah tuah hai sehla ti na duhmi kha midang hrangah va tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Nangmah a lo duhdawtu lawng na duhdawt a si ahcun ziangah so thlawsuah malsawm ngah ding cu na zum? Misual pawl khal in anmah a duhdawtu cu an duhdawt ve a sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nangmah parah ṭhatnak a tuahtu hrang lawngah ṭhatnak na tuah ve ahcun ziangah so thlawsuah malsawm ngah ding cu na zum? Misual pawl hman in cuvek cu an tuah ve a sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka ngah sal ding tiih na zummi hnen lawngih na coih ahcun ziangah so thlawsuah malsawmnak ngah ding cu na beisei? Misual pawl hman in an ngah sal ding ahcun misual dang pawl hnenah an coih ve a sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutiin a si lo! Nan ral pawl duhdaw uhla an parah ṭhatnak tuah uh. Coih uhla ngah sal ding ruat duh hlah uh. Cuticun ṭhatman tampi nan ngah ding ih Cungnungbik Pathian ih fa nan si ding. Ziangahtile amah cu miṭha lo le lungawi hna hman a thiam lomi par khalah a ṭha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nan Pa cu mi zaangfah thiam a si vekin nannih khal mi zaangfah thiam va si ve uh,” tiah Jesuh in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi va soisel hlah, Pathian in a lo soisel ve lo ding. Midang va hnong hlah, Pathian in a lo hnong ve lo ding. Midang ngaidam awla Pathian in a lo ngaidam ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Midang hnenah thil ṭhen aw, Pathian in a lo ṭhen ve ding. Tamzet in, liam thluahthlo in, na kut sungah pek na si ding ih na zawi thei nawn lo tiangin burh na si ding. Midang parih na hmanmi tahnak khi Pathian in na parah a hmang ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in hi tahṭhimnak hi a sim: “Mitcaw pakhat in a dang mitcaw a hruai thei lo ding. A hruai asile an pahnih in korhrum sungah an tla ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tlawngta cu a saya hnakin a thiam sawn dah lo; asinain tlawngta cu a zirnak a ṭheh tikah cun a saya bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Nan mit sungih thingtum a ummi sawn hman ruat loin ziangah so na unau mit sungih mit-hnawm fate lehlam na zoh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na unau hnenah ‘Unau, zaangfahte in na mit sungih mithnawm kha ka lo coih sak pei,’ tiah ziangtinso na ti thei? Nangmah mit sungih thingtum hman na hmuh thei si lo! Mi titer aw pawl! Hmaisabik ah nan mit sungih thingtum kha suahta uhla cuih hnuah nan unau mit sungih mithnawm kha coih dingah ṭhatein nan hmu ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thingkung ṭha in rahsia a rah dah lo; thingkung ṭha lo in rah ṭha khal a rah thei ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thingkung hmuahhmuah khi an rah in theih thei an si: hlingkung par ihsin thei rah nan lo dah lo; cuvekin theihmu kung ihsin sabit rah nan lo fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mi ṭha in a thinlung sungih a ummi thil ṭha kha a suahter; mi ṭha lo in a thinlung sungih a ummi thil ṭha lo pawl kha a suahter ve. Ziangahtile minung cu a thinlung sungih a ummi kha a kaa in a suak a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziangah so ‘Bawipa, Bawipa,’ tiah in ti ih ka lo sim mi cu nan tuah fawn lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka hnenah ra in ka thusimmi a ngai ih a thluntu pawl cu mi ziangvek an si, ti ka lo hmuhhnik ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cupa cu lungpi parah khur thukpi lai in ṭhuam a bun ih inn a saktu pa bangtuk a si. Tiva a hung lian ih cuih inn cu a sawh ciamco naón a hnin thei lo; ziangahtile fekteih sakmi inn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka thusimmi a thei naón a thlun lotu pa cu ṭhuam ṭhateih phun loin leilung meen ih inn a saktu pa vek a si. Tilian in a cuih inn cu a run pah tikah hmakhatte ah inn cu a tlu ih ziangtluk ṭihnungza so a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu hi thu hmuahhmuah a sim ṭheh tikah Kapernaum khua ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutawkah Rom ralbawi pakhat a um ih hnen-um pakhat a nei; cuih a hnen-um cu a duh ngaingai; asinain a na ih a thi zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih ralbawipa cun Jesuh thuhla a theih tikah a hnen-um ra damter dingin va dil dingah Judah mi upa pawl a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh hnenah an va thleng ih thungai thlak in an va dil. “Hi pa cu na bom ding a tlak ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan miphun a duhdawtu a si ih amah rori in kan hrangah sinakok a sak a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in anmah cu a hei thlun. A cuih inn an naih vivo tikah ralbawipa cun a rualpi pawl a rak thlah ih, “Bawipa, har rero in ra duh hlah. Ka inn hi nangih luhnak ah a tlak lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun na hnenah keimah ka ra ding ka ti khalle ka tlak thotho lo tiah ka ruat aw. Curuangah thu pe mai awla ka hnen-um cu a dam ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah khal bawi upa kut hnuai ih um ka si ih keimah ih kuthnuai khalah ralkap pawl an um. Ralkap pakhatkhat hi ‘Feh aw,’ ka ti ahcun a feh; a dang pakhat hi ‘Ra aw,’ ka ti ahcun a ra. Cun ka hnen-um cu ‘Hihi tuah aw,’ ka ti ahcun a tuah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cumi cu Jesuh in a theih tikah cupa ih zumnak cu a mang a bang ngaingai. A thluntu misenpi pawl lam ahcun a her ih, “Thungai in ka lo sim: Israel mi lak hmanah hi bangtuk zumnak cu ka tong dah lo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thlahmi pawl cu ralbawipa ih inn ah an kir ih a hnen-um pa a rak dam zo kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuihhnu reilote-ah Jesuh cu Nain an timi khua ah a feh ih a dungthlun pawl le mitampi in an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An khuahnar a thlen tikah mithi phum dingah miruunpi an ra suak. A thimi cu nuhmei nu ih fapa neihsun a si ih khawsungmi tampi in a nu cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in cu nu cu a hmuh tikah a zaangfah ngaingai ih, “ṭap nawn hlah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu a va feh ih ruakkuang cu a tham; cule a zawntu pawl cu an ding. Jesuh in, “Tlangval pa, tho aw ka lo ti!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mithi pa cu a tho ih a ṭong thei; cule Jesuh in a nu ih hnenah a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An zatein an thin a phang ih Pathian an thangṭhat. “Kan lakah a maksakmi profet a suak; a minung pawl run dingah Pathian a ra thleng zo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh ih thuhla cu cuih ram hmuahhmuah le a kiangkap ah a thang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih thu hmuahhmuah cu Johan dungthluntu pawl in Johan hnenah an sim. Cule Johan in a dungthlun pahnih a ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Johan in a ra ding tiah a timi cu na si maw, a si lole a dang kan hngak hrih ding maw?” tiin Bawipa va sut dingah a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh hnen an thlen tikah annih in, “Baptisma petu Johan in ‘a ra ding a timi cu nangmah hi na si maw, a si lole midang kan hngak hrih ding so?’ tiah sut dingah in thlah a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Culai fangah cun Jesuh in mi tampi an dam lonak le an natnak a phunphun a damter ih khawsia ih polhmi tla a damter ih mitcaw tampi tla khua a hmuhter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh in Johan dungthlun pawl cu, “Va kir uhla nan hmuhmi le nan theihmi hi Johan cu va sim uh: mitcaw in khua an hmu thei, ke-awl pawl ṭhatein an feh thei, phaarnatih a nami pawl tla an thiang sal; hnaset mi in thawmvang an thei thei, mithi pawl an thosal ih mi farah pawl hnenah Thuthang ṭha cu sim a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keimah ih thuhla ah thinlung rinhmainak a nei lotu cu mi thlawsuak an si,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Johan ih thlahmi palai pawl an kir hnuah Jesuh in Johan ih thuhla cu mipi hnenah hiti in a sim: “Ramṭhing ih nan feh tikah ziang hmu dinginso nan feh? Thli in a sem ruangah a kuur reromi hrampi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ziang hmuh duh ah so nan feh? Hnipuan mankhung a hrukmi zoh duh ah maw? Cubangtuk hnipuan mankhung a hrukih nuamzetin a umtu pawl cu siangpahrang inn lawngah an um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I sim hnik uh: Ziang zoh duh ah so nan feh? Profet zoh duh ah maw? Asi, profet zoh duh ah nan feh ngai; asinain nan hmuhmi hi profet hnakih nasa sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ziangahtile Johan thuhla hi Ca Thianghlim sungah, ‘Pathian in na hrangih lamzin sialtu dingah na hlanah ka palai ka thlah ding a ti,’ tin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: minung ih hrinmi hmuahhmuah lakah Johan hnakih a tum sawn le a nasa sawnmi zohman an um lo. Sikhalsehla Pathian Uknak sungih mi nautabik cu Johan hnakin a tum sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutiih a simmi cu mipi in an thei. Anmah le siahkhongtu pawl tla cu Pathian ih dingnak a pomtu an si ih Johan ih baptisma latu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Farasi pawl le Daanthiam pawl cun an hrangih Pathian tumtahmi kha an pom lo ih Johan ih baptisma a la duh lotu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Tuihsan milai pawl hi ziangthawn so ka ṭhim ding? Ziang bangtuk so an si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Dawr tuahnak hmunih a tomi nauhak pawl bangtuk an si. Nauhak bur khat in a dang bur khat hnenah: ‘Mopuai hla kan lo saksak naón nan laam duh lo; Mithi hla kan lo saksak naón nan ṭap duh fawn lo,’ a ti awmi nauhak pawl bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baptisma petu Johan a ra ih rawl ul le sabitti in loin a um tikah ‘Ramhuai in a polh,’ nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Milai Fapa a ra thleng ih a ei a in tikah nannih in ‘Hi pa hi zohhnik uh! Rawl phaam le sabitti phaam pa hi; siahkhongtu le misual pawl ih rualpi a si!’ in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Asinain Pathian fimnak a dik zia cu a pomtu pawl in an langter a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Farasi mi pakhat in Jesuh cu zanriah eitlang dingah a sawm. Jesuh cu a va feh ih rawl ei dingah cun a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih khua ah nunsual ih a nungmi nunau pakhat a rak um. Cunu in Jesuh cu Farasi pa innah rawl a ei ding ti a theih tikah alabaster timi lungih tuahmi thawl pakhat in zihmui a rak keng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh dunglam, a ke hramah ding tahratin a ṭap ih a mitthli in Jesuh ih ke cu a tlak ruangah a ciar. Cule Jesuh ih ke cu a sam in a hnawt hul ih a hnam hnuah zihmui a toih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cumi cu Farasi pa in a hmuh tikah a thinlungte in, “Hi pa hi profet taktak a si ahcun a tham rerotu nunau nu hi zo a si ti a thei ding ih ziangvek nuncan sual in a nung ti khal a thei ding,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesuh in Simon hnen ahcun, “Simon, thu ka lo sim duhmi a um,” tiah a ti. Simon in, “Sayapa, i sim aw he!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Tangka coihtu pa hnen ihsin tangka a cawitu mi pahnih an um. Pakhat pa in ngun tangka zanga a cawi ih a dang pakhat in sawmnga a cawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An pahnih in an sam thei lo veve. Curuangah an pahnih in a olh. Cute pahnih lakah zo deuh in so tangka coihtu cu an duhdawt deuh ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simon in, “Tangka tam deuh a olh mipa in a duhdawt deuh ding tiah ka ruat,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Jesuh in, “A dik a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cule nunau nu lam ih a her hnuah Simon hnenah cun, “Hi nunau nu hi na hmu maw? Na inn sungah ka runglut; nang in ka ke kholhnakah tidai i pe lo, asinain hi nu in ka ke cu a mitthli in a kholh ih a sam in a hnawt hul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang cun hnamnak in i rak hmuak lo, asinain hi nu cun ka ra thlen vete in cat loin ka ke a hnam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nang cun ka lu ih culh dingah olif hriak i pe lo, asinain anih cun ka ke hi zihmui in a toih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka lo sim: a mi duhdawtnak tumpi a langtermi hin a sualnak tampi cu ngaithiam a si zo ti kha a langter a si. Sikhalsehla a sualnak malte lawng ngaithiam a si mi cun duhdawtnak malte lawng a langter ve a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in nunau nu hnenah, “Na sualnak pawl cu ngaithiam a si zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Rawl einak cabuai ih a totu midang pawl cun an thinlungte in, “Sualnak hman a thlah sak theitu, hi pa hi zo vek mi so a si?” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in nunau nu cu, “Na zumnak in a lo run suak zo; hnangamte in va tlung aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawkfang a rei hnuah Jesuh cu Pathian Uknak Thuthang ṭha sim in khawpi le khawte a tlawng vivo. Dungthluntu hleihnih tla an tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule natnak a phunphun le khawsia ih polhmi pawl a damtermi nunau tla an tel ve: a sung ihsin ramhuai pasarih a dawi suakmi Mari (Magdalene ti tla in kawhmi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Herod zung ah bawi a si mi Khuza nupi Joanna, Susanna le an neihmi thilri thawn Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl a bawmtu nunau pawl tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua khat hnu khua khat in Jesuh hnenah mi an ra; mi tam ngaipi a hnenih an ratkhawm tikah hiti in tahṭhimnak a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Voikhat ah mi pakhat cu thlaici vorh dingah a feh. Lo sungih thlaici a vorh tikah a ṭhenkhat cu lamzin tluanah an tla ih cu pawl cu mi in an pal, vate in an sar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat cu lungsedaap lakah an tla ih thlaici cu an kho naón leilung a hnawng lo ruangah an caar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlaici hrekkhat pawl cu hlingbur lakah an tla ih hlingkung thawn an ṭhang tlang ih hlingkung in a zaap ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule ṭhenkhat cu leilung ṭhatnak ah an tla ih an kho ih an vui; fang zakhat fingfing an nei. Theihnak hna a neitu cun thei uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih tahṭhimnak ih tican ziang a si, tiah a dungthluntu pawl in Jesuh an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak ih thuthup theih theinak cu nan hnenah pek a si zo; asinain midang hnenah cun tahṭhimnak thawn lawngin sim a si ding. Curuangah an zoh rero ding naón an hmu thei lo ding, an ngai rero ding naón an thei thiam lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hi tahṭhimnak ih tican cu hiti in a si: thlaici cu Pathian ih ṭongkam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamzin tluan ih a tlami thlaici cu Pathian ṭongkam an thei naón Satan a ra ih an zum lonak ding le runmi an si lonak dingah an thinlung sung ihsin Pathian ih thu cu a lak hlosak mi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungsedaap lakih a tlami thlaici cu Pathian ṭongkam cu an thei ih lungawi zetin an pom. Asinain an thinlung sung thukpi ah a pil lo. Tikcu tawite sung an zum ih hniksaknak caan a thlen tikah a tlu salmi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlingbur lakih a tlami thlaici cu Pathian ṭongkam cu an thei; sikhalsehla leilung tlun donharnak, len duhnak le taksa nomnak in a khuh ih ziangtik hmanah a rah cu a hmin dah lomi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leiram ṭha ih a tlami thlaici cu Pathian ṭongkam an thei ih thinlung ṭha le zawnlungte ih a cem tiang rah nei ko a pom hngettu pawl an si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Zohman in mei-inn vang tahratin kho an khuh dah lo, ihkhun hnuai khal ah an ret keel lo. Inn sungih mi an luh tikah tleunak an hmuh fiang theinak dingah mei-inn vannak tung parah an ret a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A thupte ih thuhmi hmuahhmuah cu langter thluh sal a si dingih khuhmi thil hmuahhmuah cu khawtleu ah suahter sal ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Curuangah thu nan ngaidan ah hin ralring uh; ziangahtile thil tawkfang a neitu cu peksin a si ding ih zianghman a nei lotu cu malte ka nei tiih a ruahmi hman kha laksak a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesuh ih nu le a nau pawl kha a hnenah an ra, asinain mi an tamtuk ruangah an tong thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi pakhat in Jesuh hnenah, “Na nu le na naule pawl lenglam ah an ding ih an lo tong duh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in mipi hnenah, “Ka nu le ka naule pawl cu Pathian thu a thei ih a thluntu pawl an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Voikhat ah Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl thawn lawng sungah an lut ih an hnenah, “Tili khatlam ral ah feh uhsi,” tiah a ti. A ti vek cun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Long in an feh rero laiah cun Jesuh cu a it that! Rinlopi-ah thlisia a rung hrang ciamco; an lawng sungah tidai a lut ih a khah zik thlang tikah cun an phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl in Jesuh cu an va ṭhang ih, “Bawipa, Bawipa! Kan thi thluh zik thlang sokhaw,” tiah an ti. Jesuh cu a hung tho ih thlisia le tilet cu thu a pek. Thlisia cu a reh ih zianghman thawthaang um loin a dai khepkhep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl cu, “Nan zumnak khui-ah so?” tiah a ti. Sikhalsehla annih cu an mang a bang ih an ṭihzet; cule pakhat le pakhat, “Hi pa hi zoso a si? Thlisia le tilet tla thu a pek ih a thu an ngai hi!” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu lawng in Galilee tili ralkhat Gerasene timi peng ah an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh cu tikap ih a suah zawng ah khawsia pawl ih polhmi pakhat in a rak tong. Cupa cu caan reipi inn ah um loin le hnipuan hruk loin a tawivak vivo ih mithi phumnak lungkua sungah a um sawn ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh a hmuh tikah napi in a raak ih Jesuh ke hramah a hlon aw ih ringzet in, “Jesuh, Cungnungbik Pathian Fapa! Nang le kei ziangso kan seng aw? I hrem hram aw hlah, tiah ka lo dil!” tiah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ziangah cuvekin a au tile Jesuh in khawsia kha cupa sung ihsin suak dingin thu a pek ruangah a si. Voi tampi cu khawsia cun a tuah tikah thawnginn ah a kut le a ke thir cikcin in an ṭem khalle thir cikcin cu a phihcat thluh ih khawsia cun ramṭhing ah a hlohter ṭheu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Na hmin zoso?” tiah a sut. Anih in, “Ka hmin cu burpi ka si,” tiah a sawn. Ziangahtile khawsia burpi a sungih an um ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khawsia pawl in Jesuh cu, “Khur thukpi sungah in thlak hram hlah aw,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutawk kiangkap tlang parah vok rual tampi an tlang rero. Khawsia pawl in Jesuh cu, “Vok sungah in lutter hram aw,” tiah an dil ih an dil vek cun vok sungah a thlah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cupa ih sungin an suak ih vok rual sungah cun an lut. A cuih vok rual cu khaamsaangpi ihsin an vung dawp ih tili sungah an pil that thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cuih vok rual a khaaltu pawl in ziang a cang ti kha an hmu thluh in zamrangin an tlan ih cuih thu cu khawsung le lo lakah an than ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ziang a cang ti zoh dingah mi tampi an va feh. Jesuh hnen an thlen tikah a sung ihsin khawsia a suak mipa cu Jesuh kehram ah a to ih hnipuan hrukin le thinlung fimin a um kha an va hmu ih an ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ziang bangtuk in a dam ti a hmutu pawl in a thuhla cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih ram sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah in an ṭih ngaingai ih an zatein Jesuh cu hmun dangih feh dingin an dil. Curuangah Jesuh cu lawng sungah a lut ih a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A sungih khawsia tampi a dawi mipa cun, “Na hnenah i fehter ve aw,” tiah a dil ciamco. Sikhalsehla Jesuh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Inn ah va tlung awla Pathian in na hrangih a tuahmi thu hi va sim aw,” tiah a ti ih a tlunter. Cupa cu khawsungah a tlung ih Jesuh in a hrangih a tuahmi cu mi hnenah a sim ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesuh cu tili ral khatlam a thlen tikah mi tampi in an rak hmuak, ziangahtile caan reipi amah kha an rak hngak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cule Jairas an timi pa a ra thleng. Jairas cu sinakok uktu a si. Jesuh ke hramah a bok ih a innih ra dingin a dil,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />ziangahtile a fanu neihsun, kum hleihnih a si mi cu, a na ih a thi zik thlang. Jesuh cu a va feh ih cutiih a feh laiah cun miburpi in a kilkip in an fuuk ih an thlun luihlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cumi lakah nunau pakhat, kum hleihnih sung thidok natnak a tuartu a tel ve. A neihmi hmuahhmuah cem ṭheh in sibawi pawl hnenah a tuamhlawm aw naón zohman in an damter thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mipi lakah cun Jesuh dunglam ihsin a hung ih Jesuh ih puanzimte kha a tham; cule a thidok cu hmakhatte ah a reh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zoso i thamtu?” tiah a sut. “Zohman in kan lo tham lo,” an ti. Cule Piter in, “Bawipa, na kimvel ah mipi in an lo kulh ih an lo naih cupco a sisi!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in, “Mi pakhatkhat in i tham a si, ziangahtile ka sung ihsin huham a suah kha ka thei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nunau nu in keimah ka si ti i thei zo, tiah ṭhia rero in a ra ih Jesuh ke hramah a ra bok. Cutawkah mizapi hmuh ahcun ziang ruangah Jesuh cu a tham ih ziang vekin hmakhatte-ah a dam ti thu tla a sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka fanu, na zumnak in a lo damter zo; hnangamte in va tlung aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cutiih Jesuh a ṭong rero laiah Jairas inn ihsin mi an rak thlahmi a ra thleng ih Jairas kha, “Na fanu a thi zo; Sayapa cu hnaihnok nawn hlah,” tiah a ra ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesuh in cumi cu a thei ih Jairas hnenah, “Na thin phang hlah! Zum ringring aw; cule na fanu cu a dam ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesuh cu Jairas ih inn a thlen tikah Piter, Johan, Jeim le nauhak nu-ih nu le pa siar lo zohman inn sungah a luhter lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cutawk mithi hmunih a ummi hmuahhmuah cu riahsia in an ṭap rero. Jesuh in, “ṭap hlah uh; hi nauhak nu hi a thi lo, a itthat a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Nauhak nu a thi ti cu zokhal in an theih ruangah Jesuh cu an hnihsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in a kut in a vun kaih ih, “Ka fanu, tho aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A hung nung sal ih hmakhatte ah a hung tho. “Rawl ei ding pe uh,” tiah Jesuh in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A nu le a pa pawl cun mak an ti ngaingai. Jesuh in cuih thu cu zohman sim lo dingin a tiam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu hleihnih pawl cu hmun khatah a ko ih khawsia dawi theinak le natnak a phunphun damter theinak huham a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Pathian Uknak thu sim ding le mina damter dingah a thlah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hnenah, “Khual nan tlawn tikah zianghman keng hlah uh: kianghrol siseh, zaal siseh, rawl siseh, paisa siseh, angki hlei khal keng hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan tlun-inn ah hmun dang nan feh sal hlan lo va caam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An lo khirnak khua cu tlansan uhla anmah ralrin peknak ah nan ke ih leidip kha thingta uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cu an feh ih khawte an tlawng vivo; Thuthangṭha an sim ih khuazakip ah mina an damter vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galilee ram uktu bawi Herod in cu bangtuk ih thil a cangmi cu a theih tikah a awlok a song ngaingai, ziangahtile baptistma petu Johan a nung sal a si tiah mi ṭhenkhat in an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midang in, “Elijah a lang a si hi,” an ti ih midang ṭhenkhat cun khuahlan laiih profet pakhatkhat a nung sal a si, an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Herod in, “Johan ih lu ka tanter zo; asinain a thuhla ka theih reromi hi pa hi zo a si pei?” tiah a ti. Cule Jesuh cu hmu suak rori dingin a tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thlahmi a dungthluntu pawl cu an ra tlung ih an tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu Jesuh an sim. Cule a hruai hai ih Bethsaida an timi khua ah anmah vial lawng an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih thu cu mipi in an theih tikah an thlun. Jesuh cun cibai a buk hai ih an hnenah Pathian Uknak thu a sim ih damnak a ṭulmi pawl tla a damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni a tlak zik tikah a thlahmi hleihnih cu a hnenah an ra ih, “Hitawk hi ramṭhing a si; curuangah misenpi pawl hi fehter aw, khua le lo lakah va feh hai sehla rawl le riahnak inn tla va hawl hai seh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in, “Nanmah in an ei ding rawl cu pe uh,” tiah a ti. Annih in, “Kan neihmi hmuahhmuah cu a zatein saang hlom nga le nga pum hnih lawng a si. Minung hi zat hrang rawl kan lei cawk ding maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutawkah pacang lawnglawng thawng nga tluk an um. Jesuh in, “Mipi hi sawmnga bur ciar in toter uh,” tiah dungthluntu pawl cu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutiin dungthluntu pawl in an tuah hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh cun saang hlom nga le nga pum hnih cu a lak ih van a hun zoh ih Pathian hnenah lungawinak thawn thla a cam hnuah a phel ih mipi zem dingin dungthluntu pawl hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An zatein an ei ih an khop hnuah an hlahmi kha dungthluntu pawl in an rutkhawm ih bawm hleihnih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nikhat ah Jesuh cu amah lawng thla a cam laiah dungthluntu pawl an ra ih, “Mipi in zo in ti so?” tiah a rak sut hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Annih in, “Mihrek in baptisma petu Johan a si, an lo ti. Ṭhenkhat in Elijah a si, an lo ti. Cule midang in khuahlan laiih profet pakhatkhat a nungsal a si, an lo ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nannih in teh! Zo a si tiah so in ruat?” tiah a sut. Piter in, “Nangmah cu Pathian ih Messiah na si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih thu cu zohman sim lo dingin Jesuh in a tiam hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule an hnenah, “Milai Fapa hi a tuar nasa ding ih upa pawl, puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam saya pawl in an hnong ding. Amah cu an that ding; asinain ni thumnak ah thawhter sal a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule an zate hnenah, “Zokhal sisehla i thlun duh ahcun mah zawnruahnak kha tlansan sehla nitinte a thinglamtah phur in i thlun seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangahtile zokhal siseh amah ih nunnak a hum duhtu cu a nunnak a sung ding; sikhalsehla keimah ih hrangah a nunnak a sungtu cu a nunnak a hum ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pakhat in leilung pumpi hi co ṭheh hmansehla amah ih nunnak a sun, a si lole a hloral a si ahcun ziangso hlawhmi a neih? Hlawhmi zianghman a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi pakhat in keimah le ka thu zirhmi a zahpi ahcun Milai Fapa khal in a sunlawinak le a Pa le vancung mithiang pawl ih sunlawinak thawn a ra thlen tikah a zahpi ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: hitawk ih a ummi lakah hin, Pathian Uknak a rung thlen an hmuh hlan lo, a thi lo dingmi nan um a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thu pawl a sim hnu zarh khatah Jesuh in Piter le Johan le Jeim a ko ih thlacam dingah tlangpar ah an kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thla a cam rero laiah Jesuh cu a hmelpian a thleng aw ih a hnipuan cu a vaar tukah a tleu in a tleu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmakhatteah mi pahnih an rung lang ih an bia aw. Cuih mi pahnih cu Moses le Elijah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vancung sunlawinak thawn an rung lang ih Jerusalem khua ih a thihnak in Pathian tumtahmi a kimternak ding thu kha Jesuh thawn an ruah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Piter le a rualpi pawl cu ih-hmuh thaw zetin an rak itthat; asinain an hung ṭhang ih Jesuh ih sunlawinak le Jesuh thawn a ding tlangmi mi pahnih kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih mi pahnih ih Jesuh an fehsan zawng ah Piter in, “Bawipa, hitawk ih kan um hi a ṭha ngaingai a si! Buuk pathum in kan sak pei; nangmah hrangah pakhat, Moses hrangah pakhat, Elijah hrangah pakhat,” tiah a ti. Amah cun ziang ka ṭong ti hman a thei ngah ngaingai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭong rero laiah mero a hung zaam ih a thlaam in a run phen; cutiih mero in a run tuam ruangah dungthlun pawl cun an ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule mero sung ihsin aw pakhat in, “Hi pa hi ka hrilmi ka Fapa a si, a thu ngai uh,” tiah a run ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuih aw a reh tikah Jesuh amah lawng an hmu. Dungthlun pawl cu daitein an um; an hmuhmi thuhla cu cuih caanah cun zo ih hnen hmanah an sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A thaisun ah Jesuh le a dungthlun pathum cu tlang ihsin an rung suk ih mipi tamzet in Jesuh kha an rak hmuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cule mipi lak ihsin mi pakhat a au ih, “Sayapa, ka fapa neihsun hi i ra zoh sak hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Khawsia in a polh ih rin lopi in a au a kio ih a tlu ṭheu; a kaa in cilbuanra a suak ih harzet koin a tuah, a thlah duh hrimhrim lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khawsia dawisuak dingah na dungthluntu pawl ka dil rero naón an ti thei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nannih pawl hi ziangtluk zumnak nei lo le mi sualral phun so nan si! Ziangtik tiangso nan hnenah ka um ding? Ziangtik tiangso ka lo tuar hrih hai ding?” tiah a ti. Cule mi pa hnenah cun, “Na fapa cu hinah rak hruai aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cutiin Jesuh hnenih nauhakpa a rat laiah khawsia in leilung ah nauhakpa cu a thluk ih zianghman thei loin a dirhcaih ciamco. Jesuh in khawsia cu a kawk ih nauhakpa cu a damter; cule nauhakpa cu a pa ih hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pathian cahnak huham an hmuh tikah mipi cu an mang a bang ngaingai. Jesuh ih thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah an hmuh tikah mipi cun mak an ti zet; cutiih an um laiah a dungthluntu pawl hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Thu ka lo sim ding ih cumi cu ziangtik hmanah hngilh hlah uh. Milai Fapa hi an phiar ding ih thuneitu kut ah pek a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a dungthluntu pawl in a simmi tican an thei lo. An theih thei lonak dingin thuhmi thu a si ruangah an thei thei lo ih an sut ngam fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cun anmah lakah zoso a tum bik, timi thu-ah an el aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />An ruahmi kha Jesuh in a theih ruangah nauhakte pakhat a hruai ih a kiangah a dinter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule an hnenah, “Ka hmin in hi nauhakte a cohlangtu cu keimah i cohlang a si; keimah i cohlangtu cu i thlahtu a cohlang a si. Ziangahtile nanmah lakih mi nautabik cu a tum bik a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Johan in, “Bawipa, mi pakhat cu na hmin in ramhuai pawl a dawi rero kan hmu ih kan dawn; ziangahtile kan bu sungtel a si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Dawn hlah uh; ziangahtile zokhal sisehla a lo dodal lotu cu a lo bawmtu an si,” tiah Johan le dungthluntu dang hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesuh vancungih laak a sinak ding caan a nai cuahco thlang tikah Jerusalem ih feh hrimhrim dingin a ruatcat ih a pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A hmaiah palai a thlah sung ih cupawl cu ziang hmuahhmuah rak timtuah sungtu dingah Samaria khua pakhat ah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cuih khawsungmi pawl in an duh lo, ziangahtile Jerusalem khua ah a lan ding ti an theih fiang ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cumi cu a dungthlun Jeim le Johan in an hmuh tikah Jesuh hnenah, “Bawipa, hi pawl siatral ṭheh dingah vancung ihsin meisa tlakter sehla na duh lo maw?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Jesuh cu an lamah a her ih a kawk hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu khawte dangah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Cutiih a feh vivo laiah mi pakhat in Jesuh cu, “Na fehnak kipah ka lo thlun ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Cinghnia pawl in kua an nei ih vate tla in bu an nei; sikhalsehla Milai Fapa cun riahnak le lu hngauhsannak hmun khal a nei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Mi pakhat hnenah Jesuh in, “I thlun aw,” a ti. Asinain cupa cun, “Bawipa, ka pa ka va phumta hmaisa pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Mithi cu mithi pawl in phum ko hai seh. Nang cu feh awla Pathian Uknak thu phuang sawn aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A dang pakhat in, “Bawipa, ka lo thlun ding; asinain hmaisabik ah ka sungte pawl ka va biakta pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah, “Zokhal dunglet hoi phah ih lei a lettu cu Pathian Uknak hrangah santlai lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Bawipa in midang sawmsarih le pahnih a hril ih amah a fehnak ding khawkip le hmunkip ah khan pahnih pahnih in a rak thlah sung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hnenah cun, “Rawl khawm ding a tamzet naón a khawmtu ding an malte a si. Curuangah rawl khawmtu ding tam sinsin a thlahnak dingah lo neitu hnenah thla cam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Va feh uh! Cinghnia rual lakih tuu faate thlahmi bangin ka lo thlah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutiih nan feh tikah paisa bawm siseh, zaal siseh, kedam siseh keng hlah uh; lamzin ih nan tonmi pawl biak dingah cawlta hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn pakhatkhat sungih nan va luh tikah a hmaisabik ah, ‘Hi inn sungah daihnak um hram seh,’ tiah va ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daihnak a duhtu a si ahcun daihnak na parah um hram seh, tiah cibai nan buknak cu a parah a umta ding; cuti a si lo ahcun nan hnenah daihnak cu kir salseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih innah cun um uhla an lo pekmi poh kha in uhla ei uh; ziangahtile hnaṭuantu in a hlawhman cu a ngah a ṭul a si. Inn pakhat ihsin inn dangah ṭhawn duldo hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khua pakhat nan thlen ih tlun-inn an lo on a si ahcun an lo pekmi pohpoh cu ei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />cuih khawsungih mina pawl tla damter uhla cuih khuami pawl cu, ‘Pathian Uknak a nai zo,’ tiah sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla khua pakhat nan thlen ih an lo tlunter lo asile khawsung lamzin ah feh uhla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Kan ke ih a kopmi nan khua ih leivut khal nanmah engtainak ah kan thingfai ṭheh a si. Asinain Pathian Uknak cu nan kiangah a ra thleng zo, ti ciing ringring uh,’ nan ti pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thungai in ka lo sim: Thuṭhennak Ni ah cuih khuami hnakin Sodom khuami hnenah Pathian in zaangfahnak a nei sawn ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Maw Khorazin khua, na hmakhua a va pit so! Maw Bethsaida khua, na hmakhua a va pit so! Na sungih mangbangza ka tuahmi pawl hi Tai-ar khua le Sidon khua ah tuah rak sisehla, cuih khawsungmi pawl cun an sualsir langternak dingah buri hnipuan hrukin vutcam an phulh awknak a reipi zo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuṭhennak Ni ah Pathian in nang hnakin Tai-ar le Sidon khuami pawl parah zaangfahnak tam sawn a nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun nang Kapernaum khua! Van tiangih hlirsan awk na duh maw si? Hell sungah hlon na si ding!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Nan thu a ngaitu pawl cu ka thu a ngaitu an si. A lo hnongtu cu keimah i hnongtu an si. Cule keimah i hnongtu cun keimah i thlahtu khal an hnong a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawmsarih le pahnih thlahmi pawl cu lungawi zetin an ra kir sal ih, “Bawipa, na hmin in ramhuai pawl kan dawi tikah kan thu an ngai a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Nimthlakau bangin vancung ihsin Satan a tlak kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai uh! Huham neihnak ka lo pek hai: rul le varngen-meipir pawl parah nan feh thei ding; nan ral neh theinak huham khal ka lo pek ih zianghman in a lo tuahmawh thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thlarau ṭha lo in nan thu an ngai ruangah nan lungawi hlah uh; nan hmin vancungih ngan cia a si ruangah nan lungawi sawn uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh cu Thlarau Thianghlim in lungawinak thawn a khatter ih, “Maw ka Pa, lei le vanih Bawipa, mifim le mithiam pawl hnenih sim dah lomi thil cu fimthiamnak a nei lomi hnenah na langter ruangah na parah ka lung a awi. A si ka Pa, hiti ih a cangmi hi na duhzawng ih a cangmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka Pa in ziang hmuahhmuah ka hnenah i pe zo. Fapa hi zo a si ti Pa siar lo zohman in an thei lo; cule Pa hi zo a si ti khal Fapa le, Pa ih thu Fapa in an hnenih a phuan ciami pawl siar lo zohman in an thei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl lamah a her ih anmah lawngih theih dingin, “Nan hmuhmi thil pawl nan hmuh hi ziangtluk vannei so nan si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: profet tampi le siangpahrang tampi in nan hmuhmi hi hmuh ve an duh naón an hmu thei lo; theih ve an duh naón an thei ngah lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Daanthiam saya pakhat a ra ih a sualnak hawl dingin Jesuh hnenah, “Sayapa, kumkhua nunnak ka ngah theinak dingah ziangso ka tuah ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ca Thianghlim in ziangtinso a ti? A timi cu na pomdan ziangtinso a si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Bawipa na Pathian cu na thinlung hmuahhmuah, na nunnak hmuahhmuah, na cahnak hmuahhmuah le na ruahnak hmuahhmuah thawn na duhdaw pei ih na innhnen cu nangmah na duh awk vekin na duh hai ve pei, a ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Na simmi cu a dik a si; cu bangtuk in va tuah awla na nung ding,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Daanthiam pa cun amah le amah thiam coter awk a duh ruangah Jesuh kha, “Zoso ka innhnen cu a si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Voikhat ah mi pakhat cu Jerusalem ihsin Jerikho ah a vung feh. Cutiih a feh laiah suamhmang pawl in an kai ih a hnipuan an hliit hnuah thizikte in an thawi ih an tlansan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Culai ah puithiam pakhat cu cuih lamzin ah a vung feh ngelcel; asinain cupa a hmuh tikah khatlam kam in a hrial ih a fehsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in Levi mi pakhat khal a va feh ve ih mina pa cu a hei zohhliahta ih khatlam kapin a hrial ih a fehsan ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain Samaria mi pakhat cu cutawk lamzin ah khual a tlawng ve ih cuih mina pa hnen a thleng ih a hmuh tikah a zaangfah ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A hei fuuk ih a hma cu siti le sabitti a hnih ih ṭhatein a tuam sak. Cule a hruaimi rannung parah toter in khualbuk ah a fehpi ih cunah ṭhatein a tuamhlawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A thaisun ah ngun tangka fanghnih a suah ih riahbuk kiltupa cu a pek ih, ‘Hi pa hi ṭhatein run tuamhlawm awla hi lam ih ka ra kir sal tikah hi pa na zohnak hrangih na cemmi hmuahhmuah cu ka lo ruul sal thluh ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh in, “Suamhmang ih an kaih mipa ih innhnen cu himi pathum lakah hin zo hi so a si, tiah na ruat?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Daan zirhtu saya in, “Amah a zaangfahtu pa hi a si,” tiah a let. Jesuh in, “Feh awla cubangtuk in va tuah ve aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu khual an tlawng vivo ih khua pakhat an thleng. Martha timi nu in Jesuh cu a inn ah a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Martha ih naunu cu Mari a si. Mari cu Jesuh ih kehram ah a to ih a thusimmi kha a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Martha cu hnaṭuan tampi nei in a buai ih a thin a ṭeu ruangah Jesuh hnenah, “Bawipa, ka naunu in hnaṭuan hmuahhmuah i tun ṭheh hi na poisa lo maw si? Sim aw, i ra bawm seh!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Martha, Martha! Nang cu thil tampi parah helhkam le awloksong in na um;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />a ṭul ngaingaimi cu pakhat lawng a si. Cumi cu Mari in a hril ngah ih zohman in an lawng nawn lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khatah Jesuh cu hmun pakhat ah thla a cam. A ṭheh tikah a dungthlun lakih pakhat in, “Bawipa, Johan in a dungthlun pawl thlacam a zirh vekin thlacam in zirh ve aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Thla nan cam tikah hiti in nan ti pei: ‘Kan Pa, Na hmin thianghlim cu upat si ko seh, Na Uknak thleng hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nitin kan ṭulmi rawl in pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan parih sualnak a tuahtu pawl kan ngaithiam bangin, kan sualnak in ngaithiam ve aw. A harmi hniksaknak ah in thlengter hlah aw,’ tiah nan ti pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a dungthlun pawl hnenah, “Thuṭhimnak ah nanmah lakih pakhat in na rualpi inn ah zanṭim ah feh tahratin ‘Ka rual, sang hlom thum in i coih hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka rualpi pakhat khualtlawnnak ihsin ka inn a ra thleng ih rawl pek ding zianghman ka nei lo,’ tiah na va ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule thuṭhimnak ah a innsung ihsin na rualpi cun ‘I hnaihnok hlah. sangka ka khar zo ih ka faale thawn kan it zo; thil pe dingin ka tho paih nawn lo,’ tiah ti bang sehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ziangtinso na tuah ding? Thungai in ka lo sim: a rualpi na si ruangah hung tho in na dilmi saang cu lo pe lohli lo hmansehla ningzak loin na dil rero hrat ahcun a tho pei ih na ṭulmi cu a lo pe ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Curuangah hiti in ka lo sim: dil uh, nan ngah ding; hawl uh nan hmu ding; king uh, nan hrangah sangka on a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile a diltu hmuahhmuah in an ngah ding, a hawltu cun an tong ding ih a kingtu hrangah sangka cu onsak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nannih pale pawl lakah na fapa in ngasa lo dilsehla rul a petu nan um pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asilole arti a dil tikah varngen-meipir a petu nan um pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo nan si ko naón nan faale hnenah cun thil ṭha pek nan thiam a si ahcun vancung nan Pa in ziangtlukin so a diltu hnenah Thlarau Thianghlim cu a pek sinsin ding!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in a ṭong thei lo mipa hnenin ramhuai pakhat a dawi suak; cutiih a dawi suak hnuah a polh mipa cu a ṭong thei. Cule misenpi cu an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭhenkhat cun, “Hitiih ramhuai pawl a dawi theinak cu ramhuai uktu bawi Beelzebul in huham a pek ruangah a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midang pawl in Jesuh sualnak hawl an duh ve; curuangah, “Pathian ih lungkim mi na si le si lo theihnak ah hmuhsaknak tuah aw,” tiah an fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in an ruahnak kha a thei ih an hnenah, “Ram pakhatkhat ṭhen tampi ah a ṭhen aw ih ṭhenkhat le ṭhenkhat a do awmi ram cu rei a awh lo ding; a rem aw lomi innsang cu an ṭhenṭhek aw ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cubangtuk ṭhiamṭhiam in Satan uknak sung khalah bu tampi ah um in bu khat le bu khat an do awk le ziangtinso cuih Satan uknak cu rei a awh thei ding? ‘Beelzebul in huham a lo pek ruangah ramhuai na dawi thei,’ tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuti vekin Beelzebul ruangah ramhuai ka dawi thei ngai ti bang sehla, nanmah a lo thluntu pawl in teh ziangtinso ramhuai an dawi thei? A lo thluntu pawl lala hi nanmah parih thuṭhentu an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kei cun Pathian cahnak thawn ramhuai ka dawi thei a si sawn; cutiin a si ruangah Pathian Uknak cu nan hnenah a ra thleng zo, ti a lang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mi cakzet pakhat in a hriamnam neihmi hmuahhmuah thawn a inn a kilven ahcun a thilri pawl cu an him.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a cak deuh sawn pa in cupa cu a do ih a neh ahcun a rinsan zetmi a hriamnam pawl cu a lawng ṭheh ih a lonmi thilri pawl cu mi a zemdarh ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Keimah i ṭan lotu hmuahhmuah cu i dodaltu an si; a khawm i bawm lotu hmuahhmuah cu a ti darhdaitu sawn an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thlarau pakhat cu mi pakhat sung ihsin a suah tikah colhnak hmun hawl in ramcaar le ramṭhing ah a vak vivo. Colhnak hmun a ton lo tikah ‘Ka tlansan zomi ka inn ah ka kir sal ding,’ tiah amah tein a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun a kir sal ngaingai tikah a inn cu faizet le umnak dingah duhnungza zetin a va hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a feh ih amah hnakih a siava deuhmi ramhuai pasarih a va sawm ih cutawkah an ra um. Cule a netnak ahcun cupa cu a hlan hnakin a besia sinsin a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh in hi thu a sim ṭheh tikah misenpi lakih nunau nu pakhat in Jesuh cu, “A lo hringtu le a lo tuamhlawmtu nunau cu mi thlawsuak a va si so!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh cun, “Pathian thu a thei ih a thlun taktaktu pawl cu mi thlawsuak an si sawn,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mitampi in Jesuh cu an pan ih an fuuk cupco laiah Jesuh in, “Tuih san minung hi an va ṭha loso! Hmuhsaknak tuahsak ding an dil, sikhalsehla Jonah hmuhsaknak siar lo hmuhsaknak dang zianghman tuahsak an si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Profet Jonah cu Nineveh minung pawl hrangah hmuhsaknak a rak si bangtuk in Milai Fapa hi tuih san minung pawl hrangah hmuhsaknak a si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuṭhen Ni ah Siangpahrangnu Sheba cu a tho ding ih tuih san minung pawl hi sual a puh ding, ziangahtile Siangpahrang Solomon fimnak thuzirhmi ngai dingah lamhlapi ihsin a ra thleng; asinain thungai in ka lo sim: Solomon hnakih tum sawn hinah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuṭhen Ni ah Nineveh khawsung mi pawl an tho ding ih sual an lo puh ding, ziangahtile Jonah in an hnenih thu a sim laiah an sualnak an sir aw a si; thungai in ka lo sim: Jonah hnakih tum sawn hinah a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Zohman in mei-inn vang tahratin an thup dah lo, a si lole kho an khuh dah keel lo; mei-inn vannak tung parah an ret ih cuticun a ra luttu pawl in khua ṭhatein an hmu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nan mit tla cu nan pum hrangah mei-inn bangtuk a si. Nan mit a fim ahcun nan pumpuluk in a tleu ding, asinain nan mit a ṭhat lo ahcun nan pumpuluk in a thim ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah nan sungih tleunak hi thimnak a si sal lonak dingah ralring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nan taksa pumpuluk cu malte hman thimnak sungah um loin a tleu ṭheh a si ahcun mei-inn in nan taksa a tlet vekin a tleuzet ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thu a sim ṭheh tikah Jesuh cu Farasi mi pakhat in rawl ei a sawm; cuhrangah Jesuh cu a feh ih rawl ei dingah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh cu rawl a ei hlanih a kut a kholh lo kha Farasi pa cun a hmuh tikah a lau ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in a hnenah, “Nannih Farasi pawl cun nan khuat le pakan pawl a lenglam lawng nan kholhfai ṭheu, asinain nan sunglam cu duhhamnak le ṭhat lonak in nan khahter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi aa pawl! A lenglam a tuahtu Pathian in a sunglam tla a tuah a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Curuangah nan khuat le nan pakan pawl sungih a ummi kha mi farah pawl pe uhla ziang hmuahhmuah nan hrangah a thiang ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Farasi pawl, nan hmakhua a va pit so! Hanghnah hangrah sungin puṭinan le remhmui le aithing le a dangdang tla cu ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat nan pek ko naón dingnak le Pathian duhdawt ding cu nan daithlan. A dang khal daithlang cuang loin hi pawl cu nan tuah dingmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Farasi pawl, nan hmakhua a va pit so! Sinakok ah tokham ret sak ciami parih to cu nan duh tuk lawmmam ih sumdawrnak tluan ih upatnak an lo pek tla cu nan sunsak bik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nan hmakhua a va pit so! Nannih cu hminsinnak a nei lomi thlaan, mi in an theih thiam lo ruangah an pal ṭheu mi thlaan bangtuk nan si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cutikah Daanthiam saya pakhat in, “Sayapa, hiti ih na ṭong tikah kannih khal in hmuhsuam ve a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Daanthiam saya pawl, nannih hrang tla-ah nan hmakhua a pit a si! An phurh thei lo ding thilrit khi mi ih zaang parah nan suang ih nanmah cun phurh bawm dingah nan kut zimte hman nan suah zuam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nan hmakhua a pit a si! Nan pupa pawl ih an rak thahmi profet pawl hrangah thlaan ṭhaṭha nan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cuticun nan pupa pawl ih thil tuahmi cu nan lungkimpi a si ti nan langter; annih in profet pawl an that ih nannih in an thlaan nan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian ih Fimnak in ‘An hnenah profet le tirhthlah pawl ka thlah ding; ṭhenkhat an that ding ih a ṭhen an hrem ding,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah tuih san mi pawl hi leilung hramthok ihsin profet pawl an thah ruangah hrem an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: Abel thah a tuarnak ihsin thokin biakṭheng le Hmun Thianghlim karlakih an thahmi Zekhariah tiang, thisen a suah ruangah tuih san mi pawl in hrem an tuar ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nannih Daanthiam saya pawl, nan hmakhua a va pit so! Fimnak inn luhnak sangka tawhfung cu nan keng; cule nanmah nan lut duh lo ih tlunah luh a duhmi pawl nan kham fawn a si,” tiah Jesuh in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin Jesuh cu a feh tikah Daanthiam saya pawl le Farasi pawl in nasa zetin an engtai ih thil tampi thu ah thu tampi an sut;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />pakhatkhat ṭong sualmi a neih ahcun amah ih ṭong lala ih awk aw dingin thu tampi an suhnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miburpi a thawngthawng in an tong aw ih an pal awk cupco laiah Jesuh cun a dungthlun pawl hnenah a hmaisa ah hiti in a sim: “Farasi pawl ih thilnu hi ralring uh; an titer awknak thilnu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangkhalsiseh khuhmi pohpoh cu on thluh an si ding ih thuthup hmuahhmuah cu phuan ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuticun khawthim lakih nan simmi thuthup pohpoh kha sun khawvang lakah theihter thluh an si ding ih inn kharhkhumin thupte ih nan simmi cu inn tlun luanglu ihsin aupi a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka rualle uh, ka lo sim hai: taksa pum lawng a that thei ih cuhnakih besia dang a tuah thei lotu cu va ṭih hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zoso ṭih ding sawn, ti ka lo sim hai ding: a thah lawng si loin hell sungih thlak theinak khal thu a neitu Pathian lawng ṭih uh. Fiangtein ka lo sim: Amah hi nan ṭih dingmi cu a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sunṭam panga kha pia hnih ah an zuar a si lo maw? Asinain pakhat hman Pathian in a hngilh lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan lu parih samphang hman a siar ṭheh. Curuangah nan thin phang hlah uh; sunṭam tamzet hnakin nan sunglawi sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hitiin ka lo sim: zokhal sisehla keimah ih ta a sinak kha mi hmaiah a phuang ngamtu cu Milai Fapa in Pathian ih vancungmi pawl hmaiah cubangtuk in a phuang ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi hmaiah i hnongtu cu Milai Fapa in Pathian ih vancungmi pawl hmaiah a hnong ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Zokhal siseh Milai Fapa a simsiatu cu ngaihthiam an si pei; sikhalsehla Thlarau Thianghlim a simsiatu cu ngaihthiam a si lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sinakok ah siseh, ram uktu a si lole hotu bawi hmaiah siseh khiing dingih an lo hruai tikah ziangtinso ka ṭan ding ih ziangso ka ṭong ding tiah va helhkam hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ziangahtile a cuih caan ah nan ṭong dingmi cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a lo sim ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misenpi lakih mi pakhat in, “Sayapa, ka pa ih in roh tami rothil in zem ve dingah ka u in sim sak aw,” tiah Jesuh kha a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Ka rual, nan karlakih thuṭhentu si dingah le nan rothil zemsaktu dingah zo in so thu i pek?” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule mi zapi hnenah cun, “Duhhamnak a phunphun kha ralring uhla fimkhur zetin um uh; ziangahtile mi pakhat ih nunnak taktak cu, ziangtluk milian a si hmanah, a thilri neihmi ahhin a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh in hi tahṭhimnak hi a sim: “Voikhat ah milian pakhat a um ih a ram sung ihsin rawl tampi a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah a thinlung tein ‘Ka lo sungsuak rawl retnak ka nei nawn lo. Ziang ka tuah ah so a ṭhat ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hitiin ka tuah pei: Ka rawl-inn pawl ka bal pei ih tum deuh in ka sak pei. Cunah ka rawl le ka thilri hmuahhmuah ka ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule keimah le keimah cu: Mi vannei pa! Kum tampi sung na ṭul dingmi thilri na nei zo. Na duhduh in nung huahho aw; ei aw, in awla nuam zetin nung aw, ka ti aw ding,’ tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in a hnenah, ‘Mi-aa pa! Tuih zan rori-ah na nunnak hi a cem ding; cule na hrangih na khawlcia mi na thil hmuahhmuah hi zo in so a co ding?’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Jesuh in, “Anmah ih hrangah thilri an khawl ih an lianzet naón Pathian mithmuh ah a lian lomi cu himi pa bangtuk an si,” tiah a netnak ah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh in dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Cu a si ruangah nan ei dingmi rawl hrangah siseh, nan sinfen ding hnipuan hrangah siseh, donhar in um hlah uh, tiah ka lo sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ziangahtile nunnak cu rawl hnakin a thupi sawn ih taksapum cu hnipuan hnakin a thupi sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlangak khi zohhnik uh; annih in thlaici an tuh lo ih rawl khal an khawm fawn lo. Rawl-inn le cuam khal an nei lo. Asinain Pathian in a cawm hai. Nannih tla cu vate hnakin a let tampi in nan sunglawi sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nanmah lakah zotal in ei-in le sinfen thu a helhkamnak in a nunnak malte a sauter theitu nan um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutluk thil fate hman nan tuah thei lo a si ahcun ziangah so thil dangdang thu cu nan helhkam duh rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hramlak pangpar tla khi ziangvekin an ṭhang ti zohhnik uh: hna an ṭuan lo, sinfen an zaal fawn lo. Sikhalsehla thungai in ka lo sim: Siangpahrang Solomon ih lennak le sunlawinak hmuahhmuah hman in hi pangpar pakhat ih mawinak hi a tluk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuihsun ah a um naón thaisun ahcun a um nawn lomi, meisa sungih paih-mi hramlak hrampi hman khi a thuamtu cu Pathian a si. Nannih tla cu a lo thuam sinsin lo ding maw si? Nan zumnak a mal tuk lawmmam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ei ding le in ding thu lawng ruat le helhkam ringringin um hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ziangahtile leilung tlunih khawvel mi pawl in cubangtuk thil cu an ruah ringringmi a si. Nan Pa in hi bangtuk thil nan ṭul ti cu a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah nan Pa ih Uknak kha helhkam in hawl sawn uhla thil dang pawl cu a lo pe leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuurun tete tla, nan thinphang hlah uh; ziangahtile nan hnenah Uknak pek cu nan Pa ih lungawi zawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nan neihmi thilri pawl zuar ṭheh uhla nan ngahmi tangka cu mifarah pawl ṭhen uh. A siat thei lomi tangka bawm nan hrangah ngaihtuah uhla vancung ah nan sumsaw pawl khawl uh. Cutawkah cun fifir in an dai thei lo ding ih a tlap thei fawn lo ruangah ziangtik khalah a hloral dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ziangahtile nan sumsaw umnak ah nan thinlung khal a um ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ziangbangtuk thil a ra thlen khalle ralring ciain um uhla nan mei-inn vangin timlaam ciain um uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mopuai ihsin a ra kir dingmi an bawipa a hngaktu hnen-um pawl bangin ralring zetin um uh. An bawipa cu a rat ih sangka a king tikah hmakhatte ah sangka cu an ong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An bawipa a ra kir tikah itthat loteih ralrinnak a neimi hnen-um pawl cu ziangtluk lungawiza so an si. Thungai in ka lo sim: a tim a tuah hnuah a toter ding ih amah rori in a tuamhlawm hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zanṭim ih a ra kirah siseh, cuhnak tlai ih a kir khalah siseh, ralrinnak nei ih a ra hmuhmi pawl cu an hrangah ziangtluk lungawiza so a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule hihi ciing uh: inn neitu pa in fifir ratnak ding tikcu kha a theih cia ahcun a inn kha a bauhter hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuvekin nannih khal ralringte in um uh, ziangahtile a ra ding tiih nan zum lo laiah Milai Fapa cu a ra thleng ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Piter in, “Bawipa, hi tahṭhimnak hi kanmah ih hrangah na timi a si maw, asilole misenpi hrangah so?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zoso rinsan tlak le a fimmi hnen-um cu a si? Rinsan tlak le a fimmi hnen-um cu a bawipa in a innpi kilkhawitu dingah le a dang hnen-um pawl kha a tikcu caan te ih an covo rawl pe dingah a ret dingmi hnen-um kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A bawipa innih a ra kir tikah hna a rak ṭuan rerotu hnen-um cu ziangtluk lungawiza so a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thungai in ka lo sim: cuih hnen-um cu a bawipa in a thilri hmuahhmuah kilkhawitu-ah a ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cuih hnen-um in, ‘Ka bawipa cu a rei hrih ding,’ a tiih hnen-um dang nunau siseh mipa siseh a thawi vivo ih a ei a in ih a riit a bah ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />cuih hnen-um in a ra ding ti a zum lo caan le a theih lo ni ah a bawipa cu a ra thleng ding. A bawipa in a satcip seksek ding ih thulung lo le rintlak lo pawl lakah a re ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A bawipa in tuahter a duhmi hnaṭuan a thei naón tiimlaam a tuah lotu hnen-um cu nasa zetih vuak a tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Asinain a bawipa in tuahter a duhmi a thei lo naón thil pakhatkhat a tuahtu hnen-um cu vuak tlak a si khalle dimte deuh ih vuak a tong ding. Tampi a ngahtu hnen ihsin tampi dil sal a si ding. Tam ngaingai pek a si mi hnen ihsin tam ngaingai dil sal a si ve ko ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Leilung tlunah hin meisa kangter dingah ka ra thleng; atu-ah hin alh thlang sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Baptisma lak ding ka nei ih cumi tuah ṭheh a si hlan cu ka thinlung a baangzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Leilung tlun ahhin remnak a run keng tiah maw si in ruat? A si lo, remnak si loin ṭhenṭheknak sawn ka run keng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Atu thok ihsin innsungsaang pakhat ih mi panga a ummi pawl cu an ṭhen aw ding; pathum in a dang pahnih kha an engtai ding ih pahnih in pathum kha an engtai ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Pale in an fapa pawl an engtai ding ih fapa pawl in an pale pawl an engtai ve ding. Nule in an fanu pawl an engtai ding ih an fanu pawl in an nule pawl an engtai ve ding. Nile pawl in an vahle pawl an engtai ding ih an vahle pawl in an nile pawl khal an engtai ve ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesuh in misenpi hnenah, “Nitlaknak lam ihsin khawdur a suah tikah hmakhatte ah ‘Ruah a sur ding,’ nan tiih a sur ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Cule thlanglam ihsin thli a hran nan theih tikah ‘Thaw a sa ding,’ nan tiih a sa ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nannih titer awk thiam pawl! Van le leilung nan zoh ih ni khua ṭhat ding le siat ding nan sim thei! Cuti asilekhaw ziangah so tuih sanih thu-umzia nan theih thiam lo?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ziangah so thil dik tuah dingah nan thinlung nan ṭhen cat thei lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Mi pakhat in a lo khiing ih zung a lo thlenpi tum a si ahcun zung a lo thlenpi ngah hlanah amah thawn remnak tuah dingah va zuam aw. Cuti na tuah lo ahcun thuṭhentu hmai tiang a lo dir ding ih thuṭhentu in palik kut ah a lo pe ding ih cuticun thawng ah thlak na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: na kuan dingmi a neta bik pia khat tiang na kuan ṭheh hlan lo cutawk ihsin na suak hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Culai ahcun mi ṭhenkhat in Jesuh hnenah, Galilee mi pawl in Pathian hnenih thawinak an pek laifangah Pilat ih a thahmi pawl thu kha an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Cuih Galilee mi pawl cutiih thah an si ruangah midang Galilee mi hnakin an sual sawn, tiah nan ruat maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An sual deuh cuang lo! Fiangtein ka lo sim: Nan sual nan sir ih nan nun daan nan ṭhin lo ahcun anmah vekin nan thi ṭheh ve ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siloam hmunih donhleisang a tluuk tikah minung hleiriat a nenthatmi pawl thu kha teh ziangtinso nan ruat? Cutiih an thih ruangah Jerusalem ih a ummi midang pawl hnakin an sual cuang a si ti a langter tiah nan ruat maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A si hrimhrim lo! Fiangtein ka lo sim: Nan sual nan sir ih nan nun daan nan thleng lo ahcun anmah vekin nan thi ṭheh ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah hiti in tahṭhimnak a sim: “Hlanlaiah mi pakhat in a hmuan sungah theipi kung pakhat a cing. A rah le rah lo a va zoh ṭheu ih a rah a hmu dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah hmuan kiltu hnenah, ‘Zohhnik, hi theipi hi! Kum thum tiang rori a rah maw rah lo, tiah ka ra veh ṭheu naón a rah zianghman ka hmu lo. Hau mai aw! Ziangah so leiram ṭha a ei rero ding?’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hmuan kiltu in ‘Bawipa, kum khatte cu zuah hrih ko aw! A kimvel in leilung ka lai ding ih dawm ka burh hrih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule a hnakum ah rah a rah asile lungawiza a si ding; a rah thotho lo asile hauter leh siseh,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Voikhat ah Sabbath ni ah Jesuh in sinakok ah thu a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutawkah khawsia ih polhmi nunau pakhat a um. Cuih khawsia cun kum hleiriat sung a ngorter; a el tla a kuun ṭheh ih dingtein a um thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cunu cu Jesuh in a hmuh tikah a hei auh ih, “Nunau nu, na natnak ihsin na luat zo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A parah a kut a suang ih hmakhatte ah dingtein a um thei ih Pathian kha a thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sinakok kiltu upa pakhat cu Sabbath ni ah Jesuh in mi a damter ruangah a thin a heng ih mipi hnenah a ṭong ih, “Hnaṭuannak dingah ni ni ruk a um; cuih ni ruk sungah cun ra uhla damter aw uh; Sabbath ni ahcun si hlahseh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Titer aw pawl! Zokhal si uhla Sabbath ni ah nan caw le nan laak pawl an hri nan phoih ih tidai innak ah nan fehpi ciar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Atu hitawk ah hin Abraham tesinfa Satan in kum hleiriat sung ṭemhrennak a tuartu a um; anih hi a ṭemhrennak ihsin Sabbath ni ah luatter a si lo ding maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thulehnak cun a ral pawl cu an ningzak koin a tuah; cule mipi pawl cu khawruahhar thil tampi a tuah ruangah an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak cu ziang bangtuk so a si? Ziang thawn so ka ṭhim ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi pakhat in anṭam ci a lak ih a lo sungih a vorhmi bangtuk a si. A vorhmi cu a kho, a ṭhang ih thingkung ah a cang ih a ṭeek parah vate tla in bu an tuah a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak cu ziang thawn so ka tahṭhim ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nunau pakhat in thilnu malte a lak ih sangphut bawm khat sungah a phulh ih sangphut cu a zatein a thoter ṭhehtu thilnu bangtuk cu a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesuh cu Jerusalem lam pan ih a feh laiah khua pakhat hnu pakhat pal phahin thu a zirh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi pakhat in, “Bawipa, runnak a ngahtu hi mi malte lawng maw an si ding?” tiah a sut. Jesuh cun hiti in a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“A fiakmi sangka ihsin luh zuam uh; ziangahtile mi tampi in cuih sung luh cu an zuam rero ding naón an ti thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inn neitu bawi a pok ding ih sangka cu a khar ding; cule a lengah dingin sangka cu nan king ding ih ‘Bawipa, sangka in rak on hram aw,’ nan ti khalle ‘Khuitawk ihsin nan rat ka thei lo,’ a lo ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule nannih in, ‘Nangmah thawn rawl kan ei tlang ih tidai khal kan in tlang a si kha! Kan khawsungah tla thu in zirh rero kha!’ tiah nan ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sikhalsehla anih cun ‘Khuitawk ihsin a rami nan si ka thei lo. Nannih miṭha lo pawl, ka hnen ihsin tlan ṭheh uh,’ tiah a lo ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nannih pawl cu a lengah hlonhlo nan si ding ih Abraham, Isaak le Jakob le profet hmuahhmuah tla cu Pathian Uknak sungih an um kha nan hmu lai ding; cutikah nannih cu nan ṭap nan raak ding ih nan hacang nan rial ciamco ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nisuahlam le nitlaklam in siseh, saklam le thlanglam khal in siseh, mi an ra ding ih Pathian Uknak rawl ei puai ah an tokhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah cun atu-ih a neta bik hi hmaisa bik an si ding ih hmaisa bik hi neta bik an si leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuih caanah Farasi mi ṭhenkhat pawl Jesuh hnenah an ra ih, “Herod in thah a lo duh ruangah hitawk in suak awla hmun dangah feh aw,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Va feh uhla cuih cinghnia pa cu ‘Tuihsun le thaisun cu khawsia pawl ka dawisuak pei ih mina pawl ka damter lai ding. Cule a ni thumnak ah ka hnaṭuan cu ka ṭheh ding a ti,’ tiah va sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah tuihsun, thaisun le tipsun cu ka feh vivo hrih ko ding. Jerusalem khawsung siar lo hmun dangah profet thah ding cu a cang lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Maw Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Profet pawl na that ih na hnenah Pathian in palai a tirhthlahmi pawl tla lungto in na deng. Arpi in a thla hnuai ah a faate pawl a huh vekin na minung pawl cu voi tampi ka kut in hum ka duh naón in sen dah lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Curuangah nan Biakinn cu hmun ṭhing ah a cang ding. Fiangtein ka lo sim: ‘Bawipa ih hminin a rami cu Pathian in thlawsuah hram seh,’ tiah nan sim thei caan a thlen hlan cu ka hmel in hmu nawn lo ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Voikhat cu Sabbath ni ah Jesuh cu Farasi hotu lakih pakhat ih inn ah rawl zawh dingin a feh; cule misenpi cun ṭhatein an rak thlir ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi pakhat a kut le a ke a thling thluhmi mina cu Jesuh hnenah a ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in Daanthiam pawl le Farasi mi pawl kha, “Kan Daan in Sabbath ni ah mina damter ding a on maw on lo so?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sikhalsehla annih cun zianghman an ṭong lo. Jesuh in mina pa cu a hruai ih a damter ih a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nanmah lakah mi pakhat cu a fapa maw a caw si maw Sabbath ni ah tikhur sungah tla pang sehla Sabbath ni a si ruangah suah loin maw nan um ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thu-ah zianghman an sawn thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rawl zawhnak hmunah mi ṭhenkhat pawl in tonak ṭha bik an hril ṭheu kha Jesuh in a hmuh ruangah hi tahṭhimnak hi an zate hnenah a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mopuai ah an lo kawh asile tonak ṭha bik cuh hlah uh. Nangmah hnakih mi upa sawn an sawm khal a si thei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nan pahnih a lo sawmtu innteek pa in na hnenah ra tahratin, ‘Na tonak hi kian aw,’ tiah a lo tiih hmun niam bikih na vung to sal tikah cun na ning a zakzet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuhnak cun an lo sawm tikah hmun niam bikah va to awla a lo sawmtu innteek pa a ra ding ih, ‘Ka rual, tonak ṭha deuhah hin hung to aw,’ tiah a lo ti ding. Cutikah sawmmi misenpi hmaiah mithmaiṭha na ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangahtile amah le amah a uang awtu cu mi nauta ah tuah a si ding ih, lungnem tangdor ih a umtu cu hmaizahnak ngahtu upa-ah a cang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in innteek pa hnenah cun, “Thaithawh siseh zanriah siseh, eitlang dingih mi na sawm tikah na rualpi pawl, na unau pawl, a si lole na sungkhat pawl le na innhnen milian pawl kha va sawm hlah; ziangahtile annih pawl cun nangmah kha an lo sawm thei leh ve ding ih na thil tuahmi kha an lo samsaal thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla rawl na daar tikah farah zonzai pawl, a zengmi pawl, ke-awl pawl le mitcaw pawl kha va sawm hai aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />annih pawl cun an lo samsaal thei lo ding hrangah malsawm dongtu na si ding. Miṭha pawl thihnak ihsin an thawhsal ni ah Pathian in a lo samsaal leh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih thu cu rawl ei-nak cabuai ih an sawm vemi pakhat in a theih tikah Jesuh hnenah cun, “Pathian Uknak sung rawldarnak puai ih a telmi pawl cu an lung a va awi ding so!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh in cupa hnenah cun, “Voikhat ah mi pakhat a um ih rawl daarnak puai tumpi a tuah ih mi tampi a sawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rawl ei caan a cut tikah a sawm ciami pawl hnenah a hnen-um a thlah. ‘Ra thlang uh, ziang hmuahhmuah timtuah a si zo,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla pakhat hnu pakhat ‘Ka man lo,’ tiin puhmawh ding an hawl fingfing. Pakhat pa in ‘Lo pakhat ka lei ih ka va zohta a ṭul a si. I rak ngaithiam aw,’ tiah hnen-um pa cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dang pakhat pa in ‘Cawcang khuah nga ka lei ih atu-ah an ṭha maw ṭha lo ka hniksak ding. I rak ngaithiam hram aw,’ a ti ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dang pakhat pa in ‘Tubaite ah nupi ka ṭhi ngelcel ih ka ra thei lo ding,’ a ti lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hnen-um pa cu a kir ih cuih thu pawl cu a bawipa ih hnenah a sim ṭheh. A bawipa cu a ai a thok ih a hnen-um pa hnenah cun, ‘Zamrang zetin khawsung lamzinpi le innlak zinte ah va feh awla mi farah, mi zonzai, kutzeng kezeng, mitcaw le ke-awl pawl rak hruai aw,’ tiah a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rei lote-ah hnen-um pa cun ‘Bawipa, na thu pekmi vekin ka tuah ṭheh zo; asinain umnak tampi a lawng lai,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah a bawipa cun, ‘Khua pakhat le pakhat karlak lamzinpi le lamzinte hmuahhmuah ah va feh awla ka inn a khah ṭheh hlan lo mi rak hruai hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: Ka rak sawm ciami pawl sungin zohman in ka zanriah daarmi an tep lo pei,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Voikhat ah mi tamzet in Jesuh cu an thlun vivo laiah an lamah Jesuh cu a her ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Zokhal siseh ka hnenah a ra ih a nu le pa, a nupi le faate pawl, a unau le a farnu pawl le amah le amah khal keimah hnakih a duh deuh a si ahcun ka dungthluntu a si thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zokhal sisehla amah ih thinglamtah phur tahratin ka dungih i thlun lotu cu ka dungthluntu a si thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nanmah lakah pakhatkhat in inn saangpi sak a tum a si ahcun hmaisabik ah tote ciamciam in a inn sak ṭhehnak dingah tangka kimtein a neih le neih lo kha a tuak ṭhehta a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutiin a tuak ṭheh hmaisa lo a si ahcun a hnaṭuan dingmi cu a thok ngah hnu-ah sak ṭheh loin a taang ding ih a rak hmutu hmuahhmuah in an hnihsan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘A hei thok ve naón a ṭheh thei si lo!’ an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ralkap thawnghra a neimi siangpahrang pakhat in siangpahrang dang pakhat ralkap thawngkul thawn amah do dingih a rami kha, a do tum a si ahcun hmaisabik ah to ciamciamin cuih siangpahrang dang do theinak ding thazaang a neih le neih lo a ruat hmaisa a ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Do theinak thazaang a neih lo a si ahcun cuih siangpahrang dang hnenah, lam hlapi ih a um laiah, remnak tuah dingah a palai pawl a thlah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in nannih tla nan neihmi hmuahhmuah nan tanta lo ahcun keimah ih dungthluntu nan si thei lo pei,” tiah Jesuh in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Cite cu a ṭhazet, asinain a alnak a ziam asile alter sal ngaihnak a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leilung hrangah san a tlai lo ih dawm hrang hmanah a ṭhahnem nawn lo. A lakih hlonhlo ding men a si thlang. Hi thu hi theihnak hna a neitu in thei uh,” tiah Jesuh in a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Voikhat ah siahkhongtu pawl le misual tiih hnonmi pawl tampi cu Jesuh thusimmi ngai dingah a hnenah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Farasi mi pawl le daanthiam pawl cu an phunzai ih, “Hi pa hin hnonmi misual tla a rak kom ih an hnenah rawl tla a ei a si!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in a tanglam tahṭhimnak hi a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Thuṭhimnak ah nanmah lakah mi pakhat in tuu zakhat nei in tuu pakhat hlo bang sehla ziangsi a tuah ding? Tuu sawmkua le pakua kha hramlak ah a tanta ding ih a hlomi a ngah sal hlan lo a hawl ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hmuh tikah a lung a awi tuk ih liangpulut tahratin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />inn ah a tlunpi. Cule a rualpi le a innhnen pawl ko khawm in ‘A hlomi ka tuu ka hmu sal ih ka lung a awi ngaingai. Curuangah lungawi in lawm uhsi,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cubangtuk in sual sirnak a ṭul lomi miṭha sawmkua le pakua hnakin a sual a sirmi misual pakhat hrangah vancungah lungawinak a tamsawn ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Cu a si lole, nunau pakhat in tangka fang hra nei sehla fang khat a thlau ahcun ziangso a tuah ding? Mei-inn vang tahratin a inn kha a phiat ih a hmuh sal hlanlo a kel le a kawm tiangin a hawl ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmuh sal tikah a rualpi pawl le innhnen pawl a ko khawm ih ‘Ka thlaumi tangka ka ngah sal zo; curuangah lungawi in lawm uhsi,’ tiah a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cubangtuk in sual sirnak a neimi misual pakhat hrangah Pathian ih vancungmi pawl an lung a awizet a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in hiti in a sim. “Voikhat ah mi pakhat a um ih fapa pahnih a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nauta sawn cun a pa hnenah, ‘Ka pa, ka co dingmi rothil atu-ah i pe aw,’ tiah a dil. Curuangah an pa cun a ro thil hmuahhmuah cu a ṭhen ih a fapa pahnih cu a zem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni rei loteah fapa nauta sawn cun a comi thilri cu a zuar ṭheh ih a ngahmi tangka thawn inn ihsin a suak. Ram hlapi ah a feh ih tenrennak zianghman um loin a tangka cu a duhduh in a thehvorh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A neihmi hmuahhmuah cu a hmang ral ṭheh. Cule cuih ram sungah paampi a tlung ih neihmi zianghman a nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah cuih ramih mi pakhat hnenah a hna ṭuansak dingah a feh ih cupa cun vok kilkhawi dingin a lo ah a fehter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vok ih an eimi be-hawng kha puar zetin ei sehla a duh zet naón zohman in ei ding zianghman an pe fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A neta bikah a thinlung a hung fim ih, ‘Ka pa ih hlawhfa pawl cun ei cawk loin rawl ei ding an nei; asinain kei cu hinah ei ding zianghman nei loin ka thi cuahco thlang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tho pei ih ka pa hnenah ka feh ding. Ka pa, Pathian parah le na parah ka sual zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na fapa si dingah ka tlak nawn lo; na hnaṭuantu na sal pakhat ah i tuah hram aw, tiah ka va ti pei,’ tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah a pa ih hnen kir dingin a pok. “Lam hlatpi ih a rat rero lai kha inn ihsin a pa in a hei hmu. A zaangfah ngaingai ih va tlan tahratin a fapa cu a kuah ih a hnam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fapa cun, ‘Ka pa, Pathian parah le na parah ka sual zo. Na fa tiih kawh ding ka tlak nawn lo,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a pa cun a hnen-um pawl a ko ih, ‘Zamrang in ra uh! Hnipuan ṭha bik rak keng uhla hrukter uh. A kutah zunghruk hrukter uhla a ke ah kedam dam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule caw faate a thau bik kha va that uhla lungawinak puai tuah uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangahtile hi ka fapa cu a thizo naón a nung sal; a hlozo naón hmuhsal a si,’ tiah a ti. Cuticun lungawi puai cu an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Cu laifangah fapa upa sawn cu lo ah a rak feh. Lo ihsin a ra tlung ih inn kiang a ra thlen tikah hlasak thawm le laam thawm a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuhrangah hnen-um pakhat a ko ih ‘Ziang so an tuah ciamco?’ tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih hnen-um cun, ‘Na naupa a ra kir sal zo, himdamte ih a ra kir sal ruangah na pa in a thaumi caw faate a thah,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A fapa upa sawn cu a thin a heng tuk ih innsung hmanah a lut duh lo. Curuangah a pa a ra suak ih innsungih rung lut dingin a leem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asinain a fapa cun, ‘Vun ruat hnik! Kum hizat liangluang sal bangin na hna ka ṭuan ih na thu voikhat hman ka lo el dah lo. Ziang so kei i pek? Ka rualpi pawl thawn nomnak puai tuahnak ah me pakhat hman i pe dah lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi na fapa cu hlawhhlang pawl thawn nomnak ah na thilri hmuahhmuah a thehvorh ṭheh ih na hnenih a ra kir sal tikah a thaumi caw faate na thah sak!’ tiah a pa cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pa cun, ‘Ka fapa, nang cu ka hnenah na um ringring ih ka neihmi thil hmuahhmuah hi nangmah ih ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asinain na naupa cu a thi ih atu-ah a nung sal; a hlozo naón atu cu ka hmu sal; cuhrangah lungawi aipuang in puai tuah tlak hrimhrim a si,’ a ti,” tiah Jesuh in a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Voikhat ah milianzet pakhat a um ih a thilri kilkhawitu dingah siahhlawh pakhat a nei. Cuih a siahhlawh pa cun na tangka a thehvorh a si, tiah a bawipa cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuhrangah a hnenah a ko ih ‘Na thu ka theihmi hi ziangtinso a si? Ka thilri na kilnak cazin kimtein i pe aw; ziangahtile ka thilri kilkhawitu na si thei nawn lo ding,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah a siahhlawh pa cun ‘Ka bawipa in ka hnaṭuan ihsin i dawi tum a si hi! Ziang so ka tuah pei? Leilung lai ding le ka ti thei lo; mi thil dil ih um ding le ka ning a zak fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain thil pakhat tuah ding ka thei! Ka hnaṭuan a cem tikah an innih i umter siangtu rualpi ṭha ka neih a ṭul ding,’ tiah a thinlung in a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuhrangah a bawipa hnenih leiba a neitu hmuahhmuah a ko khawm. Pakhatnak pa cu ‘Ziangzat so ka bawipa na baak?’ tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih in ‘Olif hriak pung zakhat,’ tiah a let. Thilri kilkhawitu pa cun ‘Hihi na cazin a si ding: to awla pung sawmnga, tiah ngan aw,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule a dang pakhat pa cu, ‘Nangteh ziangzatso na baak?’ tiah a sut. Anih in, ‘sangvut dip thawngkhat,’ tiah a let. Thilri kilkhawitu pa cun, ‘Hihi na cazin a si ding: dip zariat, tiah ngan aw,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi mihrokhrawl thilri kilkhawitu pa hi cubangtuk in fimvar zetih thil ti a thiam ruangah a bawipa in a porhzet, ziangahtile hi leilungtlun mi pawl hi anmah ih thu tawlrelnak ahcun tleunak sungih a ummi pawl hnakin an fimvar sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Cuti a si ruangah hiti in ka lo sim: leilung tlunih sumsaw hmangin rualpi tuah uh, ziangahtile leilung thilri a cem tikah kumkhua a hmunmi inn ah luhter nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil fate ih rintlak a si mi cu thil tumpi khalah rintlak a si ding; thil fate thu-ah zumtlak lo a si mi cu thil tumpi thu khalah zumtlak lo a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilung thilri nan tawlrelnak hmanah rintlak lo nan si ahcun ziangtinso lennak taktak cu nan hnenah pek nan si thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule midang thilri par hmanah rinsantlak nan si lo ahcun nanmah ih co dingmi ngaingai cu zo in so a lo pek duh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi pakhat cu bawi pahnih ih sal a si thei lo. Pakhat a hua ding ih pakhat kha a duh ding; pakhat hnenah rinsantlak in a nung ding ih pakhat tu cu a nautat ding. Pathian le sumsaw cu nan rian tlang thei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih thu pawl cu Farasi mi pawl in an theih tikah tangka duh tuk pawl an si ruangah Jesuh kha an hnihsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Miseenpi hmaiah cun miding bikah nan lang awter; asinain Pathian cun nan thinlung a thei ṭheh. Ziangahtile minung in man nei zetih nan ruahmi cu Pathian mithmuh ahcun zianghman a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Moses ih Daan le profet ih canganmi pawl cu baptisma petu Johan san tiang hrang lawngah a si. Cuihhnu cun Pathian Uknak Thuthang ṭha cu phuan a si ih zozo khal hranhram ih luh an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Daan sungih cafang fate bik hloh hnakin van le leilung hloh ṭheh a ol sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Zokhal a nupi a ma ih nunau dang a ṭhitu cu ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuah; cule maakmi nu a ṭhitu cu ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuah ve a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Voikhat ah milianzet pakhat a um ih hnipuan mankhung bik in a thuam aw ih nitin rawl thawthaw ei in nuam zetin a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lazaras an timi mi farahzet pakhat a um ve ih a pumpuluk in hma a khat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Milian pa ih cabuai ihsin a tlami rawl ṭilfuan sar dingah milian pa ih sangka ah an hruai ṭheu. Uico an ra ih a hma cu an ra liak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mifarah pa cu a thi ih vancungih rawl ei-nak puai ah Abraham kiangih to dingah vancungmi pawl in an fehpi. Milian pa cu a thi ve ih an phum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />cule Hell sungah a tla ih harzet in a tuar. Cuphah in tlunlam a hun zoh ih lamhlatzet ah Abraham le a kiangih Lazaras kha a hun hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule a au ih, ‘Ka pa Abraham, i zaangfah hram aw. Lazaras kha fial awla a kutzung kha tidaiah hnim sehla ka lei daiter dingah ti i run forhseh; ziangahtile hi meisa sungah ka tuar a har tuk a si!’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Abraham in, ‘Ka fapa, vun ruat hnik! Na nun sungah khan thil ṭha hmuahhmuah na ngah ṭheh zo ih Lazaras cun thil ṭha lo lawnglawng a co. Asinain atu-ah cun anih cu hitawk ah hin nunnuam in a um ih nang cu harnak na tuar a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih tlunah kan karlakah Kawhrum tluan thukpi a um ih curuangah hitawk ihsin na hnenah rat a duhmi zohman an ra thei lo ih na umnak ihsin kan umnak khalah hin rat duhtu an um khalle an ra thei lo a si,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutikah milian pa cun ‘Cuti a si ahcun, maw ka pa Abraham, ka pa ih inn ah Lazaras kha hei thlah hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutawkah unau panga ka nei. Lazaras kha va feh sehla annih tal cu hitawk tuarnak hmunah hin an ra thlen lonak dingah ralrinnak va pe seh, tiah zaangfah ka dil a si,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abraham cun, ‘Na unau pawl ralrinnak petu dingah Moses le profet pawl an um a si. An simmi kha rak ngai hai seh,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Milian pa cun, ‘Ka pa Abraham, cuti lawng cun a tawk lo. Mi pakhat thihnak ihsin a tho ih an hnen a thlen ahcun an nunsualnak cu an ṭhin ding,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Abraham cun, ‘Moses le profet pawl ih thu an ngai duh lo a si ahcun mi pakhat thihnak ihsin tho hmansehla an lung duh cuang lo ding,’ a ti,” tiah Jesuh in a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Sualnak sungih mi a tlatertu thil cu a ra thleng ringring ko ding; asinain cuih thil a thlentertu ih hrangah cun tuksumza a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi nauhak pakhatkhat a sualter hnak cun a hngawng ah fang rialnak lungtumpi kha thlaih tahratin tifinriat sungah hlon sehla amah hrangah a ṭhasawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah thil nan tuahmi ah ralring uh. Na unau a sual ahcun nunsim aw; a sir awk ahcun ngaithiam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na parah ni khat sungah voi sarih tiang sual hmansehla na hnenah ra tahratin ‘Ka sual ka sir aw a si,’ a ti ahcun ngaithiam aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl in, “Kan zumnak hi ṭhangter sin aw,” tiah an Bawipa cu an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An Bawipa cun, “Nannih in anṭam ci tia zumnak nan neih ahcun hi thingtheihmu kung hi ‘Na hram in phong aw awla tifinriat sungah va phun aw aw,’ nan ti thei ding ih nan ti vekin a cang ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thuṭhimnak ah nanmah lakah pakhatkhat in hnen-um pakhat a nei tibang sehla, cuih hnen-um cu lei a let, a si lole tuu a khal ti sehla, innih a ra tlun tikah ‘Zamrang awla na rawl ei aw,’ nan ti ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan ti lo ding! Cuhnakin amah cu ‘Ka hrangah zanriah i suan sak aw; cule na rawl suannak thuam hruk awla rawl ka ei sung i kil aw; cuih hnu lawngah nang cu rawl na ei leh ding,’ nan ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnen-um pa cu thu nan pekmi a tuah ṭheh ruangah lungawinak ṭongkam a parah nan ṭong dah maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in nanmah par khal ah a si ve: tuah uh, tiih an lo timi nan tuah ṭheh tikah ‘Kannih cu lom tlak lo hnen-um men kan si. Kan ṭuanvo a ṭuantu lawng kan si,’ tiah ti uh,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh cu Jerusalem lam a pan zawng ah Samaria le Galilee ramri a pal phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khua pakhat a va thleng ih cuih khawsungih phaarnat in a nami pahra in an rak tong. Lamhlat nawnah an ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Maw Jesuh, Bawipa, in zaangfah hram aw,” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in a hmu ih an hnenah, “Va feh uhla puithiam pawl in lo zoh hai seh,” tiah a ti. An feh laifangah cun an dam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anmah lakih pakhat pa in a dam ṭheh zo ti kha a hmuh awk tikah a kirsal ih aw ring zetin Pathian a thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmakhatteah Jesuh kehram leilungah cun a bok ih Jesuh hnenah lungawi thu a sim. Cupa cu Samaria mi pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Damnak a ngahtu cu mi pahra an si. Pakua teh khui-ah so an si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangah so hi ramdang mi pakhat lawng Pathian hnenih lungawinak pe dingah a rat?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Tho awla feh aw. Na zumnak in a lo damter zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Farasi mi ṭhenkhat in, “Ziang tikah so Pathian Uknak a ra thlen ding?” tiah Jesuh cu an sut. Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak cu mithmuh in a ra lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zohman in ‘Zohhnik uh! Hinah a um hi! Khinah a um khi!’ tiah an ti lo ding. Ziangahtile Pathian Uknak cu nan sungah a um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Milai Fapa ih caan ni khat tal hmu ve thei sehla tiah saduh nan thah tikcu a ra thleng ding, asinain nan hmu lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nan hnenah ‘Zoh uh! Khinah a um! Zoh uh! Hinah a um!’ tiah a lo titu an um ding. Sihmansehla zoh dingah va feh hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimthlakau in van khatlam kap ihsin khatlam tiang a hrawh ih a tlet ṭheh vekin Milai Fapa cu amah ih ni ahcun a si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asinain hmaisabik ah amah in tuarnak nasazet a tong ding ih tuihsan minung pawl in an hnong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Noah sanlai ih a rak can zo bangin Milai Fapa san khalah a cang ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Noah a lawng sungah a lut ih tilik a tlung ih mi hmuahhmuah an thih ṭheh hlan tiangin mizapi cu an nuam, an ei an in ih an ṭhi aw rero lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lot sanih a rak si zo bangtuk in a si ve ding. Zozo khal zu an in, sa an ei; thil an lei, thil an zuar; thlai an ciing ih inn an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lot in Sodom a tlansan ni ah van ihsin meisa le kaat ruahpi bangin a rung sur ih mi hmuahhmuah an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Milai Fapa a rung lang ni ahcun cuvek in a si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun a inn diphun ih a umtu cun a innsungih a ummi thilri la dingah ṭum hlah seh. Cuvek thothoin lo ih a rak umtu cu inn ah tlung hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lot ih nupi kha nan ciing lai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zokhal amah ih nunnak hum a tumtu cu a nunnak a sung ding; a nunnak a liamtu cun a nunnak a hum ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thungai in ka lo sim: cuih zaan ah ihkhun pakhat ah mi pahnih an ittlang ding; pakhat cu a lak ding ih pakhat cu a taanta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nunau pahnih sum an deng tlang ding; pakhat cu lak hlo a si ding ih pakhat cu taanta a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />(“Mi pahnih lo ah hna an ṭuan tlang ding: pakhat cu lak hlo a si ding ih pakhat cu taanta a si ding,” tiah a ti.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cun, “Bawipa, khui tawkah so?” tiah an sut. Jesuh in, “Ruak a umnak hmun ahcun langta an khawm aw ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthlun pawl kha thinnau loih thla an cam ringring a ṭulzia zirh duh ah tahṭhimnak pakhat a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hnenah cun, “Khua pakhat ah Pathian a ṭih loih milai khal a hmaizah lotu thuṭhentu pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih khua thotho ah nuhmei nu pakhat a um ih nuhmei nu cun, ‘I raltu thawn thu kan neihmi ahhin i bawm hram aw,’ tiah atu le atu a ra dil ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuṭhentu in cuih thu cu caan reipi relsak duh loin a um; asinain a netabik ahcun ‘Pathian ka ṭih lo ih mi khal ka hmaizah lo naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hi nuhmei nu in i hnaihnok ringring ruangah a thu cu ka relsak pei. Ka relsak lo a si ahcun catbang loin a ra ringring ding ih a netnak ahcun keimah lehlam thinlung baangin i tuah ding,’ tiah a ruat,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule an Bawipa cun an hnenah, “Hi a dik lomi thuṭhentu ih ṭongkam cu nan thei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuti a si ahcun Pathian in amah ih bomnak dilin sun zan a au rerotu a minung pawl cu an thu ṭhensak loin a um pei maw? Anmah bawm dingah a khul a fung pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: zamrang zetin a relsak ding ih thuding a coter ding a si. Sikhalsehla Milai Fapa hi leilungih a rat tikah zumnak neitu a hmu pei maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesuh in hi tahṭhimnak cu, miṭha ngaingai ih a ruat awmi le midang hmuahhmuah a hmuhsuamtu pawl hnenah a simmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Voikhat ah mi pahnih cu thlacam dingah Biakinn ah an feh. Pakhat cu Farasi a si ih pakhat cu siahkhongtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farasi pa cu hlat nawnah amah lawng a ding ih hiti in thla a cam. ‘Maw Pathian, kei cu midang vekin ka duhham lo, thuphan ka per lo ih ṭaangṭawm sualnak tla ka tuah lo ruangah ka lo thangṭhat. Khi tawkih a ummi siahkhongtu vek ka si lo ruangah ka lo lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zarhkhat ah voihnih rawl ka ul, ka ngahmi hmuahhmuah sungin ṭhenhra ih ṭhenkhat ka lo pek,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla siahkhongtu pa cu a hlat nawn ah a ding ih vanlam hman hoih ngam loin a ṭaang a cuum aw ih ‘Maw Pathian, i zaangfah hram aw; kei cu misual ka si,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: Farasi mi pa si loin siahkhongtu pa sawn kha inn ih a tlun tikah Pathian hmaiah thuding cotu a si. Ziangahtile zokhal amah le amah a khaisang awtu cu namthlak a si ding ih tangdortu cu khaisan a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat in an faate pawl ih parah Jesuh in a kut suangseh ti duh ah Jesuh hnenah an faate pawl cu an rak hruai. Cutiih an tuah cu a dungthluntu pawl in an hmuh tikah an kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in nauhak pawl cu a ko ih, “Nauhak cu ka hnenah ra hai seh, dawn hlah uh; ziangahtile Pathian Uknak cu hi bangtuk mi pawl ih ta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hihi ciing ṭha uh! Zokhal Pathian Uknak kha nauhak pawl ih an cohlan bangtuk in a cohlang lotu cu cuih Uknak sungah an lut thei dah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pakhat in Jesuh cu, “Zirhtu ṭha, kumkhua nunnak co dingah ziangso ka tuah ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziangah so miṭha, tiah i ti? Pathian pakhat siarlo miṭha dang zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thukham pawl na thei ko a si lo maw: ṭaangṭawm sualnak tuah hlah; lai that hlah; ruk ru hlah; thuphan per hlah; na nu le na pa kha upat aw,’ ti tla an si kha!” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cupa in, “Ka seentet lai ihsin hi thukam pawl hicu ka thlun thluh zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cumi cu Jesuh in a theih tikah a hnenah cun, “Na tuah ṭulmi pakhat a um lai. Na neihmi hmuahhmuah zuar ṭheh awla na ngahmi tangka kha mifarah pawl va pe aw; cule vancung ah sumsaw na nei ding. Cuih hnuah ra awla i thlun aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain cuih thu cu cupa in a theih tikah a riah a sia ngaingai, ziangahtile amah cu milianzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesuh in a riahsiat kha a hmuh tikah hiti in a sim: “Milian hrangah cun Pathian Uknak sungih luh cu ziangtluk in so a har!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Milian pakhat Pathian Uknak sungih luh hnakin kalauk pakhat ṭhim hnakua sungih luh khi a ol sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cumi cu mipi in an theih tikah, “Cuti asile zoso runmi a si thei ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Minung hrangih a cang thei lo timi hi Pathian hrangah cun a cang thei a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Piter in, “Zohhnik! Kan innsang taanta in nangmah kan lo thlun hi!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Asi, na simmi a dik a si; fiangtein ka lo sim: zokhal a inn siseh, a nupi siseh, a unau siseh, a nu le a pa siseh, a faate pawl siseh, Pathian Uknak hrangah a tlansan a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuih san ahhin a let tampiin ngahmi a nei ding ih a ra dingmi san ah kumkhua nunnak a ngah ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthlun hleihnih pawl kha hmun dangte ah a fehpi ih an hnenah, “Ngaihnik uh! Jerusalem ah kan feh ding ih Milai Fapa ih thu profet pawl ih an rak simmi hmuahhmuah kha a kim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Zentail mi pawl ih kut ah thlenpi a si ding ih annih in hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang ding, an dekcok ding ih an cil an phui ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An vuak ding ih an that ding, asinain ni thumnak ah a tho sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cupawl cu a dungthluntu pawl cun an thei thei lo; a ṭong ih sullam kha thuhsak a si ruangah Jesuh ih ṭongmi kha a tican an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesuh cu Jerikho khua lamah a feh ih a thlen zik zawng ah mitcaw pakhat cu lamzin kiangah kutdawh in a rak to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A kiangin mi tampi an lan kha a theih tikah, “Ziang so a si?” tiah a rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Annih in, “Nazareth mi Jesuh a ra a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Maw David Fapa Jesuh, i zaangfah hram aw,” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hmaiih a ummi misenpi pawl in an kawk ih daiteih um dingah an sim. Sikhalsehla anih cun, “David Fapa, i zaangfah hrawm aw,” tiah a au sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuhrangah Jesuh cu a ding ih, “Mitcaw pa kha hinah rak hruai uh,” tiah thu a pek. A hnenih a ra thlen tikah Jesuh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Ziang tisak dingso na duh?” tiah a sut. “Bawipa, khua hmu thei sal ningla ka duh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah, “Cuti asile khua hmu aw! Na zumnak in a lo damter zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hmakhatteah khua a hmu thei ih Jesuh kha a thlun ih Pathian a thangṭhat vivo. Cumi cu misenpi in an hmuh tikah an zatein Pathian kha an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu Jerikho khua a thleng ih khawsung in a feh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutawkah siahkhongtu upa pakhat, a lianzetmi, Zakia timi a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh kha zo a si ti hmuh a duhzet naón amah cu mi niamte a si ih tlunah mi an tamzet ruangah a hmu thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah mipi hmaiah a tlan ih cutawk lamih a feh vivotu Jesuh hmuh duh ah theipi kung parah a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh cutawk hmun a thlen tikah a tlunlam a hun zoh ih, “Zakia, zamrangin rung ṭum aw, tuihsun na inn ah ka tlung ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zakia cu zamrangin a ṭum ih Jesuh kha a inn ah lungawi zetin a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cumi a hmutu hmuahhmuah cu an phunzai hmurhmo ih, “Hi pa hi misual pa ih inn ah a tlung ual!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zakia cu a ding ih Bawipa ih hnenah cun, “Bawipa, i ngaihnik! Ka neihmi ih hrek cu mifarah ka pe ding; cule ka bummi an um ahcun a let li in ka sam sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah, “Tuih sun hi pa ih inn ah rundamnak a ra thleng zo, ziangahtile hi pakhal hi Abraham ih tesinfa a si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Milai Fapa cu a hlomi hawl ding le rundam dingah a ra,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutiih a simmi a rak ngaitu mipi hnenah Jesuh in tahṭhimnak pakhat a sim. Amah cu Jerusalem a thleng zik thlang ih mipi cun Pathian Uknak a ra thleng zik thlang tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah hiti in a sim: “Voikhat ah bawi pakhat a um ih amah cu ram hlapi ah feh tahratin siangpahrang ih canter a si hnuah innih ra tlun sal a tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutiih a feh hlanah a hnen-um pahra kha a ko ih sui tangka fang khat fingfing a pek hnuah, ‘Himi thawn sum rak tuah hnik uh; ka ra kir tikah ziangzat nan ngah, kan zohhnik pei,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ram sungmi pawl in cuih an bawipa cu an hua ih curuangah ‘Hi pa hi cu kan siangpahrang dingah kan duh lo,’ tiah a simtu dingah palai an thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Cupa cu siangpahrang a can hnuah a ra tlung sal. A thlen vete in sum ziangzat an ngah ti theih duh ah a hnen-um pahra cu a hnenah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pakhat pa cu a ra ih, ‘Bawipa, sui tangka fang khat i pekmi in sui tangka fang hra a miat ka ngah,’ tiah a ra ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A bawipa in, ‘A ṭha, nang hi hnen-um ṭha na si. Thil fate parih rintlak na si ruangah khawpi pahra uktu-ah ka lo re ding,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pahnihnak pa a ra ih, ‘Bawipa, sui tangka fang khat i pekmi in fang nga a miat ka ngah,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cupa cu ‘Khawpi panga uktu-ah ka lo ret ding,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A dang hnen-um pakhat a ra ih, ‘Bawipa, hinah na sui tangka cu a um. Pavua in ka tuam ih ka ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang cu mi tifekfek na si ruangah ka lo ṭih. Na ta a si lomi tla na lak ṭheu ih thlaici na vorh lomi khal na khawm ṭheu,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah a bawipa in, ‘Hnen-um ṭha lo! Nangmah hnonnak dingah hin nangmah ih ṭong lala ka hmang ding! Mi tifekfek ka si cu na thei ih ka ta a si lomi tla ka lak ih ka vorh lomi khal ka khawm cu na thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuti asile ziangah so ka tangka cu tangka retnak zung ah na rak ret lo? Rak ret cila ka ra kir sal tikah tangka ṭhang thawn ka ngah ding a sisi!’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule cutawkih a dingmi pawl hnenah, ‘A sui tangka cu la uhla sui tangka fang hra a neitu hnen-um hnenah pe uh,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asinain annih in, ‘Bawipa, anih cun fang hra a nei zo si!’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An bawipa cun, ‘Fiangtein ka lo sim: thil a neitu hnenah a dang khal belh a si ding; asinain thil a nei lotu hnen ihsin a neihsun malte hman kha laksak hrih a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun an siangpahrang dingih i duh lotu ka ral pawl cu hinah ratpi uh la ka mithmuh ah hin that uh,’ a ti,” tiah Jesuh in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh in hi thu a sim hnuah an hmaiah Jerusalem ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Olif tlang ih Bethphage le Bethani khua kiang a thlen tikah a hmai ah a dungthluntu pahnih kha a thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hiti in thu a cah. “Nan hmaiih a ummi khawsungah khin va lut uhla zohman ih an to dah hrih lomi laak note pakhat hri in an khihmi kha nan hmu ding. A hri phoih uhla hinah rak hruai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zokhal in ziangah so nan phoih, tiah an lo sut asile Bawipa in a hai tiah va sim uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An va feh ih Jesuh in a sim vek cekci-in ziang hmuahhmuah cu an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Laak note cu an phoih rero laiah a neitu pawl in, “Ziangah so nan phoih?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Annih in, “Bawipa in a hai,” tiah an let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule laak cu Jesuh hnenah an hei hruai. Cun laak parah cun an puan an dam ih Jesuh cu an toter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Laak par cun a feh ih a fehnak lamzin ahcun mipi in an puan an phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jerusalem khua kiang lamzin Olif Tlang ihsin a vung suhnak zawn an thlen tikah a thluntu miburpi pawl cun Pathian an thangṭhat ih, thil mak zetzet tampi an hmuh ruangah cun an aw neih patawp in an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Bawipaói hmin in a rami siangpahrang parah Pathian thlawsuahnak um ko seh! Van ah daihnak um sehla Pathian hnenah sunlawinak cu um ko seh!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule miburpi lakih a ummi Farasi ṭhenkhat pawl in Jesuh cu, “Sayapa, na dungthlun pawl hi daiteón um hai seh, sim aw!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Fiangtein ka lo sim: Annih pawl daiteih an um asile hi lungto pawl hi an hung au ciamco ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jerusalem khawpi cu a hei naih vivo ih a hmuh ngah tikah Jesuh cu a ṭap:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tuihsun ah hin daihnak hrangah ziangso a ṭul, tihi thei thei cila maw! Asinain cucu na hmuh thei lo dingin thuh a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nan ral pawl in an lo kulh ṭheh ding ih an lo kham ṭhehnak le khuazakip in an lo fuuknak caan a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangmah siseh, na phar dawlmi sungih a ummi na minung pawl siseh, an that ṭheh ding. Nangmah rundam dingih Pathian a rat tikcu na theih lo ruangah lungto pakhat hman suang aw-in a taangmi an um lo ding a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cun Jesuh cu Biakinn sungah a feh ih thil zuartu pawl kha a dawi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Ca Thianghlim sungah Pathian in ka Biakinn cu thlacamnak inn tiah kawh a si ding a ti. Asinain nannih cun fifir pawl relhnak kua ah nan canter!” tiah a kawk hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nitinte in Jesuh cun Biakinn sungah thu a zirh. Puithiam upa pawl, Daanthiam pawl le hotu pawl in Jesuh cu thah an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Asinain an thah theinak ding lamzin an hawl thei lo, ziangahtile mi hmuahhmuah in a thu simmi cu ṭongfang pakhat hman hrelh loin ngai an duh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nikhat ah Jesuh cu Biakinn sungah thu a zirh ih Thuthangṭha a sim rero laiah puithiam upa pawl, Daanthiam pawl le khawsung upa pawl a hnenah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“In simhnik! Zo ih thu in so hi bangtuk thil hi na tuah? Zo in so thu a lo pek?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thu ka lo sut ve hnik pei. I simhnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johan in baptisma pek theinak thu a neihmi hi Pathian hnen ihsin a ra maw, minung hnen ihsin so?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annih pakhat le pakhat, “Ziangtin so kan sim ding? ‘Pathian hnen ihsin a ngah,’ kan ti asile anih in, ‘Cuti asile ziangah so Johan cu nan zum lo?’ in ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain ‘Minung hnen ihsin a ngah,’ kan ti fawn asile hi misenpi pawl hin lungto in in deng ding, ziangahtile Johan cu profet a si tiah an zum ṭhehmi a si fawn,” tiah anmah le anmah an el aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah annih in, “Zo hnen ihsin a ngah ti kan thei lo,” tiah an let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Kei khal in zo hnen ihsin hi thil tuah theinak thu hi ka ngah, ti ka lo sim lo ding,” tiah a let ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Jesuh in hi tahṭhimnak hi misenpi hnenah a sim: “Voikhat ah mi pakhat in sabit hmuan a nei ih midang hnenah man pek in a hmuan cu a san hnuah caan reipi sung khual a tlawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sabit rah lawh caan a cut tikah hmuan saangtu pawl hnenah cun a covo va la dingin a sal pakhat a thlah. Sikhalsehla hmuan saangtu pawl in a salpa cu an rak vuak hnuah a kut lawngin an kirter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah a sal pakhat a thlah sal; cupa khal cu hmuan saangtu pawl cun an vuak ih ningzak koin an rak tuah hnuah kut lawngin an kirter lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule a sal dang pakhat a thlah sal. Hmuan a saangtu pawl cun an rak tuahmawh ih hmuan lengah an hlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun sabit hmuan neitu pa cun, ‘Ziangtin so ka ti ding? Ka duhdawtmi ka fapa hi ka thlah pei; amah cu an rak upat ko ding,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain hmuan saangtu pawl in a fapa cu an rak hmuh tikah pakhat le pakhat, ‘Hi pa hi hmuan neituih fapa ngaingai a si. Kan that pei ih a co ding hmuahhmuah cu kan ta ah a cang ding!’ tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah hmuan leengah an hlon ih an that. “Cuti a si ruangah hmuan saangtu pawl parah hmuan neitu in ziangso a tuah ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah cu a ra ding ih cupawl cu a thah hnuah hmuan saangtu dang hnenah a hmuan cu a saan ding a si,” tiah a ti. Cumi cu misenpi in an theih tikah, “Cuticun a ti hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in a zohhliah hai ih an hnenah, “Asile, Ca Thianghlim sungah ‘Inn saktu pawl in santlai lo ti ih an hnonmi lungto cu a thupi bikmi lungto ah a cang riangri,’ tiih nganmi kha a tican ziangso a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zokhal cuih lungto parih a tlami cu an kuai seksek ding ih cuih lungto in a tlakmi cu a zaam ṭheh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Daanthiam pawl le puithiam upa pawl in cutawk rori ahcun kaih an tum, ziangahtile a tlunih tahṭhimnak hi anmah ṭongsan in a simmi a si, ti kha an thei; asinain mipi kha an ṭih fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah an kaih theinak dingah tikcu remcaang an hawl. Mi ṭhenkhat cu Jesuh thlingthlatu dingah nawhthuh an pek ih, “Mi ṭhazet vekin um uh. Jesuh hi Rom Acozah ih thu neitu Mangki bawi hnenih kan thlenpi theinak dingah thu nan sut pei ih amah ih ṭong lala kha thang ah hmangin a awh nan zuam pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlingthlatu pawl in Jesuh cu, “Sayapa, na simmi le na zirhmi hi a dik a si tiah kan thei. Mi na thleidang lo ih minung hrangih Pathian duhnak thudik kha felteón na zirh ti tla kan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah thu pakhat in simhnik: Rom Siangpahrang hnenah ngunkhuai pek hi kan Daan in a on maw, on lo so?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in an depdetnak kha a thei ṭheh ih an hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ngun tangka fang khat i hmuhhnik uh. A parah zo ih zuk le hmin so a cuang?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Rom Siangpahrang zuk le hmin,” tiah an sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in, “Cuti a si ahcun Rom Siangpahrang ta cu siangpahrang pe uh; Pathian ta cu Pathian pe uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuti cun misenpi hmaiah a kaih an tum naón ziangti hmanin an kai ngah thei lo; thu an suhmi a lehnak an theih tikah an lau ih daiziar in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun Sadusi mi ṭhenkhat, minung hi thihnak ihsin thawhsal a um nawn lo, a titu pawl Jesuh hnenah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Sayapa, Moses in hiti in daan a nganta: ‘Mi pakhat cu faate nei loin a nupi a thihsan ahcun a unau pakhatkhat in a cuih nupi cu a ṭhi pei ih faate an neihmi kha an u mithi pa ih faate-ah ruah a si pei,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Voikhat ah unau pasarih an um. Upabik cu nupi a nei naón faate nei loin a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pahnihnak pa in cunu cu a ṭhit ih faate nei loin a thi ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pathumnak pa khal in a ṭhit ih fa nei loin a thi ve thotho. An unau pasarih in cu nu cu an ṭhinaón faate nei loin an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A neta bikah cuih nunau nu khal cu a thi ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutiin a si ih a thi ciami pawl an thawhsal tikah cunu cu zo ih nupi so a si ding? An pasarih in an ṭhi ciar fawn si!” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Tuihsan minung pawl cu nunau le mipa an ṭhi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thihnak ihsin thawhter sal dingah siseh, a ra lai dingmi san ih nung dingah siseh, a tlakmi pawl cu cuih caan ahcun an ṭhi aw nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vancungmi bangtuk an si ding ih an thi thei lo ding. Thihnak ihsin an thawhsal zo ruangah annih tla cu Pathian ih faate an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Moses in, a thimi pawl cu thawhter sal an si ti cu fiangteón a langter a si. Hrambur a kaangmi thuhla sungah khan Bawipa cu ‘Abraham ih Pathian, Isaak ih Pathian, le Jakob ih Pathian,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pathian cu a thimi ih Pathian a si lo, a nungmi ih Pathian a si; ziangahtile mi hmuahhmuah cu a hnenah cun a nungmi hlir an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Daanthiam ṭhenkhat pawl in, “Sayapa, na thu lehmi a ṭha zet!” tiah an hun ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutiin Jesuh cu thu an sut ngam nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziangtin so Messiah cu David tesinfa a si, ti theih a si ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ziangahtile David amah rori in Saam Hlabu sungah, ‘Bawipa in ka Bawipa hnenah, Na ral pawl hmuahhmuah cu na ke hnuaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ke pal dingih ka ret thluh hlan lo ka vorhlam ah to aw,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />David in ‘Bawipa,’ tiah a ti ahcun ziangtinso Messiah cu David tesinfa cu a si thei ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in a thusimmi an ngai laiah khan Jesuh in a dungthlun pawl hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Daanthiam pawl hi ralring uh! Annih tla cu an angki fualpi thawn vah sukso an uar ih dawrtluan ah khin upatnak thawn mi ih cibaibuk an duh; sinakok le puai tuahnak hmun ah khin tonak ṭhabik an hril ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nuhmei pawl an hmuhsuam ih an inn tiangin an lawng, asinain mi hmai ahcun sau zetzet in thla an cam fawn! Hremnak an tuar dingmi cu a luar cuang ding a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in a kiangkap kha a zoh ih, milian pawl in Biakinn tangka kuang sungah an thawhlawm an thlak rero kha a hmu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />cule nuhmei farah zet pakhat in paisa pia hnihte a thlakmi tla kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Fiangtein ka lo sim: hi nuhmei nu hin midang hmuahhmuah hnakin tam sawn a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangahtile midang pawl cun an neihmi sungih a hleifuan kha an pek; sikhalsehla hi nuhmei nu cu farahte asinain a nunnak dingih a neihmi kha a zatein a pek a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A dungthlun ṭhenkhat cun Jerusalem Biakinn thu, lungto ṭha zetzet ih an dawlmi mawizia le Pathian hnenih laksawng an pekmi thu pawl an rel ciamco. Jesuh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Himi hi nan hmu ṭheh; asinain hi lungto pawl hi pakhat hman an umnak keel ah um nawn loin hlon thlak ṭheh an si caan a thleng ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annih in Jesuh cu, “Sayapa, cuih caan cu ziangtikah so a si ding? Cun a tikcu a ra thleng zo, ti theihthiamnak ah ziangbangtuk hminsinnak so a um ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesuh cun, “Mi in an lo bum thei lonak dingah ralring uh; mi tampi ka hmin in an ra ding ih ‘Keimah hi Amah cu ka si,’ tiin le ‘A tikcu a kim zo,’ tiah an sim ding. Sikhalsehla va thlun hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ral le do awknak thawmvang nan theih tikah ṭih hlah uh; cu bangtuk pawl cu a ra thleng hmaisa ding, asinain a netnak a thok zo tinak a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ram khat le ram khat an do aw ding; Acozah pakhat in a dang Acozah kha a siim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilung tlun ah ṭihnungza linghnin mangṭam, le pulhnatsia a phunphun khuazakipah a tlung ding. Thil lamdang zetzet le hmuhsaknak mak zetzet van ihsin an lang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Cubangtuk thil a thlen hlanah nannih tla cu kaihnak le hremnak nan tuar ding; sinakok i nan thu rel dingin le thawngthlak dingin midang pawl ih kut ah pek nan si ding. Keimah ih ruangah siangpahrang le uktu bawi pawl ih hmaiah suahpi nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cucu nan hrangah Thuthang ṭha simnak caan ṭha a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangtin so kan hum awknak dingah kan ṭan ding tiah a hlankhan ihsin nan donhar lo dingin nan thinlung rak timtuah cia uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangahtile ṭongkam thiamnak le fimnak nasa zetin ka lo pe ding ih nan ral pawl zohman in nan ṭongmi kha an el thei lo ding ih nan palh a si, a ti theitu khal an um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nan nu le nan pa, nan u le nan nau, nan sungkhat le nan rualpi pawl in an lo phiar ding ih mi ṭhenkhat cu thah tla nan tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keimah ih ruangah mi hmuahhmuah in an lo hua ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nan lu parih samphang pakhat hman a tlong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hnget zetin ding ko uh; cuticun nan run aw ngah ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ralkap pawl in Jerusalem an kulh ṭheh nan hmuh tikah a siat cing ding ti kha nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Judea ih a ummi pawl cu tlang parah nan tlan pei; khawpi sungih a ummi pawl cu khawpi nan taanta pei ih khawpi leeng hramlak ih a ummi pawl khal khawpi sungah nan lut lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ziangahtile himi cu ‘Hremnak Ni,’ a si ding ruangah Ca Thianghlim ih a rak sim ciami hmuahhmuah kha a kimnak tikcu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih caan cu nunau favun pawl le naukai nei nunau pawl hrangah cun an hmakhua a pit a si! Hi leilung parah ṭihnungza harsatnak a ra thleng ding ih Pathian hremnak cu hi minung pawl parah a tlung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat cu ralnam in an thi ding ih mi ṭhen cu leitlun ramkipah salah hruai an si ding. Jerusalem cu Pathian thei lotu Zentail pawl in an tikcu a cem hlanlo an ke hnuai ah an pal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ni le thlapi le arsi pawl parah khin thil lamdang zetzet a um ding. Leitlun pumpi ah vansaannak a um ding, ziangahtile tifinriat a awnmi le tilet a thomi kha an ṭih ding ih an thinlung a hnok ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitlun pumpi parah a ra thleng dingmi thil an ruah tikah mi tampi cu an thinpit in an tlu ding, ziangahtile vanih cahnak huham pawl cu a pingpeng ah an feh ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutikah Milai Fapa cu mero lakin sunlawinak le a nasa zetmi huham thawn a lang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi bangtuk thil a ra thlen vivo tikah ding uhla tlunlam zoh uh, ziangahtile nan luatnak a nai zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in hi tahṭhimnak hi a sim: “Theipi kung siseh, thingkung dang thu khal siseh, ruathnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hnah note a cerh tikah khuaṭhal caan a nai zo ti nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cu bangtuk in hi thil pawl a tlun ih a kim vivo tikah Pathian Uknak cu a thleng zik thlang a si, ti thei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Atuih a nungmi pawl an thih ṭheh hlanah hi thil hmuahhmuah cu a thleng kim ṭheh ding ti kha ciing ṭha uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Van le lei cu a hloral leh ding naón ka thu cu a hloral dah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ralring in um uh! Puai tuah ih zu in le sa ei in siseh, nun khuasaknak helhkam in siseh, va um hlah uh; nan um asile rin lopi ah cuih Ni cu a ra thleng ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />thang bangin a lo awk ding. Ziangahtile cuih Ni cu leilung tlun mi hmuahhmuah parah a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ralring zetin um uhla, a ra thleng dingmi thil hmuahhmuah hi himte ih nan pahsuak theinak dingah thazaang nei dingin le Milai Fapa hmaiih nan din theinak ding ah cat loin thla cam uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih caan hrawngah Jesuh cu Biakinn ah thu a zirh ih zanlam a si tikah a suak ih Olif tlang ah a va riak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in a thu zirhmi ngai duh ah zingpitte in Biakinn ah an feh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lantak Puai an timi, thilnu tel lo sang puai cu a thleng zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl cu misenpi kha an ṭih ruangah Jesuh kha a thupte ih an thah theinak ding lamzin an hawl rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule dungthluntu hleihnih sungih a telmi Iskariot an timi Judas sungah Satan a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Judas cu a va feh duak ih Jesuh an hnenih a zuar thei ding thu puithiam upa pawl le Biakinn kiltu bawi pawl hnenah a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annih khal cu an lung a awizet ih tangka pe dingin an lung a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judas khal a lung a kim ve ih misenpi theihter lo tein an kut sungah Jesuh a pek theinak ding tikcu remcaang a hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thilnu tel lo saang Puai tuah ni a thleng ih Lantak Puai hrangih tuu note pawl thahnak tikcu a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesuh in Piter le Johan a thlah ih, “Va feh uhla Lantak Puai rawl kan ei tlaangnak ding va tawlrel uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih in, “Khui-ah so va tuah dingin in duhsak?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih in, “Khawpi sungih nan va luh tikah tibeel in tidai a khaitu pa nan tong ding. Cupa cu a luhnak inn tiang va thlun uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cule cuih inn neitu hnenah cun ‘Keimah le ka dungthlun pawl Lantak zanriah kan einak ding khaan khui-ah so a um tiah kan Sayapa in a lo ti,’ tiah va ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlunta khaan ah tokham le cabuai pawl kimteih an retmi khaan tumpi a lo hmuh ding ih cutawkah cun ziang hmuahhmuah va tawlrel uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An feh ih Jesuh ih a sim vek cekci in ziang hmuahhmuah cu an hmu ih cutawkah cun Lantak zanriah cu an timtuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tikcu a kim tikah Jesuh cu cabuai ah a dungthluntu pawl hnenah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hnenah cun, “Hi Lantak zanriah hi harsatnak ka tuar hlanah nanmah thawn eitlang dingah ka duhzetmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangahtile fiangtein ka lo sim: Pathian Uknak sungah hi Lantak zanriah ih tican taktak kimter a si hlanlo ka ei nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in khuathai a lak ih Pathian hnenah lungawi thu a sim hnuah, “Himi hi lak uhla hlawm aw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: Pathian Uknak a ra thlen lai hlanlo hi sabitti hi ka in nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun saang hlom khat a lak ih Pathian hnenih lungawi thu a sim hnuah a phel ih a dungthluntu pawl hnenah cun a pek. “Himi hi nan hrangih ka pekmi ka taksa a si. Keimah in theih ringringnak dingah run tuah uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in zanriah an ei ṭheh tikah khuathai cu an hnen ah a pek ih, “Hi hai cu nan hrangah ka thletmi ka thisen thawn nemhngetmi Pathian thukam thar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla zohhnik uh! I zuartupa cu atu-ah hi cabuai ahhin keimah thawn kan umtlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian lairel cia bangtuk in Milai Fapa cu a thi ding, sikhalsehla Milai Fapa a zuartu pa hrangah cun a hmakhua a pit a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah cubangtuk thil cu zo bikin so a tuah pei, tiah anmah le anmah an sut aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl lakah zoso a tum bik ih ruah ding a si, tiin thu-el awknak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Leitlun siangpahrang pawl in misenpi pawl kha lal zetin huham thawn an uk ih cuih uktu bawi pawl cun ‘Miseenpi ih Rualpi,’ tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nannih cu cubangtuk nan si lo ding; nanmah lakih upa bik cu nauta bik bangtuk in a um ding ih hotu bik cu hnen-um bangin a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zoso a tum deuh: To in rawl a eitu maw, rawl petu so? A totu kha a tum sawn a si lo maw? Sikhalsehla kei cu nan lakah a lo riantu vekin ka um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Harnak ka tuar sung hmuahhmuah ah i umpitu cu nanmah nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka Pa in uk theinak thu i pek vekin kei khal in uk theinak thu ka lo pe ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka Uknak sungih ka cabuai ah nan ei nan in ding ih Israel phun hleihnih uktu dingah bawi tokham parah nan to ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Simon, Simon, ngaihnik! Lothlo pa in fang cu a fangngai le a hii a thiatdan ṭheu vekin Satan in nanmah lakah thiatdang dingah le nan zatein hniksak dingah thu a ngah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Simon, na zumnak a tlaksam lonak dingah na hrangah thla ka cam. Cule ka hnen lam na hoikir sal tikah na unau pawl kha thazaang na pe pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Piter in, “Bawipa, nangmah thawn thawng tlatlaang dingah le thitlaang dingah ka tiar a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Piter, fiangtein ka lo sim: Tuihzan ah ka thei hrimhrim lo tiah voithum tiang i phatsan hlanlo ar a khuang lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl kha, “Tangka bawm le zaal le kedam keng loin ka lo thlah laiah khan ziangtal tlaksammi nan nei maw?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Tlaksammi zianghman kan nei lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Sikhalsehla tuih ṭum cu tangka bawm a nei mi in tangka bawm keng uh, zaal a nei mi in zaal keng uh. Ralnam a nei lo mi in a korfual zuar in ralnam pakhat leiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ziangahtile fiangtein ka lo sim: Ca Thianghlim in ‘Amah cu misual lakah a tuar ve a si,’ tiah keimah ih thu an nganmi kha a kim ding; ziangahtile keimah ih thu nganmi hmuahhmuah kha a kim vivo zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl in, “Bawipa, zohhnik! Hinah ralnam pahnih a um!” tiah an ti. Anih in, “Cu vial a tawk!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh cu khawpi lengah a suak ih a feh ṭheunak Olif tlang ah a hung feh; dungthluntu pawl khal an feh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuih tlang a thlen tikah an hnenah, “Sualforhnak sungih nan luh lonak dingah thla cam uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cule lungden ban tluk a hlatnak ah a va feh ih a khuk bilh in thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Ka Pa, na lungkimmi a si ahcun hi tuarnak hai hi i lak sak hram aw. Sikhalsehla keimah ih duhnak si loin nangmah ih duhnak vekin si ko seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Van ihsin vancungmi a rung lang ih thazaang a rung pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A thinlung a baangzet ih taimak sinsin in thla a cam; a suakmi a thlan cu thifor bangin leilung ah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thlacamnak ihsin a tho ih a dungthluntu pawl hnenih a va kir tikah an rak itthat ṭheh kha a hmu; an thinhar in an baangzet ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An hnenah, “Ziangah so nan ihthat? Sualforhnak sungih tla lo dingin tho uhla thla cam uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesuh a ṭong rero laiah dungthluntu hleihnih lakih pakhat a si mi Judas ih a hruaimi miburpi pawl an ra thleng. Jesuh hnam dingah Judas cun a hun fuuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in, “Judas, Milai Fapa hi hnamnak in maw na zuar?” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesuh hnenih a ummi dungthlun pawl in ziang a cang ti kha an hmuh tikah Jesuh cu, “Bawipa, kan ralnam hi kan hmang ding maw?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cule anmah lakih pakhat in Puithiam Saang ih salpa a vun saat ih a vorhlam hna a saat thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cun, “Tawk seh!” a ti ih an tuahmawh mipa ih hna cu a tham ih a damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in amah kai dingih a ra thlengmi puithiam upa pawl le biakinn kiltu bawi pawl le khua upa pawl hnenah cun, “Kei hi suamhmang maw ka si, ralnam le talhtum thawn nan rat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Nitinte in nan hnenah Biakinn sungah ka um naón zohman in in kai lo! Sikhalsehla atu hi khawthim huham a cah lai caan a si ih nannih nan hnaṭuan caan a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesuh cu an kai ih Puithiam Sang ih innah an fehpi; cule Piter in a hlat nawn in a thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tual laifangah meipual an sep ih mei a aitu pawl hnenah cun Piter khal a to ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hnen-um nu pakhat in Piter meisa kiangih a to kha a hmuh tikah hmaiton-in a zohhliah ih, “Hi pa hi Jesuh hnenih a tel vemi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Asinain Piter in, “Nunau nu, cupa cu zo a si ti hman ka thei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Malte a rei hnuah mi pakhat in a hmu ve ih, “Nang tla na tel ve ko,” tiah a ti. Asinain Piter in, “Mi pa, kei ka tel lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Cule nazi pakhat tluk a rei hnuah midang pakhat in, “Hi pa hi Jesuh hnenah a tel ve, ti cu zum lo ding ṭha a si lo; ziangahtile amah khal hi Galilee mi a si ve ko,” tiah fiang zetin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Asinain Piter cun, “Maw mipa, ziang nan ṭong ti hman ka thei lo,” tiah a ti thotho. Cutiih a ṭong rero laiah cun ar a khuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Bawipa cu a her ih Piter kha a zohhliah; cule Piter cun Bawipa in, “Tuihzan ar a khuan hlanah voithum tiang ka thei lo tiah i phatsan ding,” a timi kha a vun mang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Piter cu a suak ih ninghang zetin a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Jesuh a kiltu pawl in amah cu an dekcok ih an thawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />A hmai puan in an tuam ih, “Zoso a lo thawi? Simhnik!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Cule nautatnak ṭongkam tampi khal an ṭong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Khua a hung vang ih upa pawl, puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl an tongkhawm aw ih Jesuh cu khonsil hmaiah an suahpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Annih in, “Messiah na si maw? In simhnik!” tiah an sut. Jesuh in, “Ka lo sim hmanah in zum lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Cule thu ka lo sut khalle in let fawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu thokin Milai Fapa cu Cungnungbik Pathian ih vorhlam kapah toter a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />An zatein, “Cuti asile Pathian Fapa maw na si?” tiah an ti. Anih in, “Ka si kha nanmah in nan sim!” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Cule annih pawl in, “Theihpitu dang kan ṭul nawn lo. Amah ih awkam rori kan thei zo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An zatein an pok ih Jesuh cu Pilat hmaiah an hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutawkah cun sual an puh ih, “Hi pa hin kan misenpi a hruai sual ih kan kai a si; Rom Siangpahrang hnenah ngunkhuai nan pe lo ding, tiah a sim ih, ‘Messiah ka si, Siangpahrang ka si,’ a ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilat in, “Judah siangpahrang na si maw?” tiah a sut. Jesuh in, “Nangmah in na sim zo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Pilat in puithiam upa le misenpi hnenah cun, “Himi pa hi a sualnak ka hmu lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain an ṭangṭha sinsin ih, “A thu zirhnak ruangah Judea peng pumpi-ah hnaihnawhnak a khat. Galilee in a thawh ih atu hitawk a thleng zo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilat in cumi cu a theih tikah, “Hi pa hi Galilee mi a si maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pilat in Jesuh cu Herod ih ukmi ram sungmi a si ti kha a theih tikah Herod hnenah Jesuh cu a kuat. Culai fangah Herod cu Jerusalem khawsungah a rak um ngelcel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Herod in Jesuh kha a hmuh tikah a lung a awi ngaingai, ziangahtile a thu kha a thei ringring ṭheu ih hmuh a duhnak a rei zet zo. Jesuh ih a tuahmi hmuhsaknak kha hmu ve sehla a saduhthah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Herod in Jesuh kha thu tampi a sut, asinain Jesuh cun kam khat hman a let lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl cu hmailamah an ra suak ih Jesuh cu nasazet in sual an puh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Herod le a ralkap pawl in Jesuh cu hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang ih an dekcok. Cule puan mawizet an sinter ih Pilat hnenah an kuat sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A cuih ni rori-ah cun Herod le Pilat cu rualpi ṭha ah an cang; cuih hlanah cun a hua aw zetmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilat in puithiam upa pawl, hotu pawl le mipi pawl cu a kokhawm ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an hnenah cun, “Hi pa hi ka hnenah nan rak hruai ih misenpi a hruai sual a si, tiah nan ti. Asinain hitawk nan mithmuh ah ka zingzoi naón sual nan puh mi hmuahhmuah ahhin a sualnak zianghman ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Herod khal in a sualnak a hmuh lo ruangah ka hnenih a rak kuat salnak a si. Thihnak tlak ih a tuahmi thil pakhat hman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah ka vuak pei ih ka thlah pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />(Lantak Puai tuah tinte in an hrangah Pilat in thawngtla pakhat a thlah ṭheu.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pilat ih ṭong an theih tikah misenpi cu an au ciammam ih, “Amah that aw! Barabbas in thlahsak sawn aw!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Barabbas cu khawpi sungah buainak a suahpitu le mithat a si ruangah thawngih an thlakmi a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilat in Jesuh cu luatter a duh ruangah misenpi hnenah thu a sim sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla annih cun, “Thinglamtah ah that aw! Thinglamtah ah that aw!” tiah an au thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat cun voithumnak tiang a sim sal ih, “Ziang sualnak so a tuah? Thihnak tlak ih a tuahmi sualnak ka hmu hrimhrim lo. Ka vuak ding ih ka thlah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an aw neih patawp in an au ih Jesuh cu thah ding hrimhrim a si, tiih an au sinsin ruangah a netnak ahcun an au-nak in a neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah an dil vekin Pilat in Jesuh cu thah dingin a relcat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misenpi in suak seh tiih an duh mipa, thubuai ruang le mi thah ruangih thawngih an thlak mipa cu Pilat cun a suah; cule misenpi saduhthah vekin Jesuh cu an duhduh ih tuah dingah an kut ah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ralkap pawl in Jesuh cu an hruai ih an feh laiah cun Sairin khua mi Simon, khawte lam ihsin khawpiih a rami pa an tong. Cupa cu an kai, thinglamtah an putter ih Jesuh dungin an thlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi tampi in Jesuh an hruaimi cu an thlun ih cu lakah an ṭaang cuum in a raak kio rerotu nunau ṭhenkhat an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cun dunglet a hoih ih an hnenah, “Maw Jerusalem nunau pawl, ka hrangah cun ṭap hlah uh; nanmah ih hrang le nan faate pawl hrangah ṭap sawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ziangahtile ‘Naute a nei dah lomi, fa a vun dah lomi le voikhat hman naute pawhte a fawh dah lomi nunau pawl hi an van a va ṭha so!’ tiih an ti caan a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih caan cu mi in tlang sangpi hnenah ‘In run nen aw,’ tiin le mual hnenah ‘In run khuh aw,’ tiih an ti caan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziangahtile thing a hrin lai hmanah hi bangtuk thil an tuah a si ahcun thing a ro tik sinsin ahcun ziang a bang pei maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh thawn hmun khatih thah dingah misual pahnih khal an hruai ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Luruh,” an timi hmun an thlen tikah cutawk hmunah cun Jesuh cu thinglamtah parah an thlai ih misual pahnih khal cu a vorhlam ah pakhat, a kehlam ah pakhat an thlai ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka pa, an sualnak run ngaithiam aw. Ziang kan tuah ti an thei lo,” tiah a ti. Cule amah a thattu pawl cun camcawhfung zuukin a hnipuan cu an zem aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Misenpi pawl in an cuan ih an zoh ringring laiah Judah mi hotu pawl cun nautatnak thawn, “Midang hmuah a run ngah ṭheu; Pathian ih hrilmi Messiah a si ngaingai ahcun amah le amah khal run aw seh,” tiah an ṭongsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ralkap pawl khal in an hnihsan ve ih amah va fuuk tahratin a man olmi sabitti thur an pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Judah siangpahrang na si ahcun nangmah le nangmah run aw aw he!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A lu tlun ah, “Hi pa hi Judah Siangpahrang a si,” tiah nganmi ca an taar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thinglamtah parih an khenmi misual pa pakhat cun nautatnak ṭong thawn, “Nangmah hi Messiah na si lo maw? Nangmah le nangmah run aw awla kannih tla hi in run ve aw he!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Asinain misual pakhat pa cun, “Pathian na ṭih lo maw si? Kan parih thuṭhennak an tuahmi hi a bangrep ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kannih pahnih parih an tuahmi thuṭhennak hi cu a dikmi a si, ziangahtile kan thil tuah ruangih kan tuar tlakmi kan tuar a si. Asinain hi pa hi cu sualnak zianghman a tuah lo,” tiin a mawhthluk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule Jesuh hnenah, “Maw Jesuh, Siangpahrang ih na rat tikah i hngilh hram hlah aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesuh in cu pa ih hnenah cun, “Thu ka lo kam a si: tuihsun ah keimah thawn Paradis ah na um ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sun nazi hleihnih hrawngin cuih ram pumpuluk ah zanlam nazi pathum tiang thimkhawzing a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cule Biakinn ih zaarmi puanzar cu a tlek ih ṭhen hnih ah a ṭhen aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesuh cu napi in a au ih, “Ka pa, ka thlarau na kut sungah ka lo pe,” tiah a ti. Cutiih a sim ṭheh hnuah a thaw a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cumi cu ralbawi pa in a hmuh tikah Pathian kha a thangṭhat ih, “Hi pa hi cu sualnak nei lo miṭha a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cuih thil hmuahhmuah zoh dingah a rami mipi pawl in cuih thil a cangmi pawl an hmuh ngah tikah ninghang in an ṭaang an cuum ih riahsia in innah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Pumpak in Jesuh a theitu hmuahhmuah le Galilee ihsin a rak thluntu nunau pawl tla cun a hlat nawnah an ding ih an cuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Judea ram Arimathea timi khua ah Josef an timi mi pakhat a um. Amah cu miṭha le upat hmaizah tlakmi a si ih Pathian Uknak a ra cing ding, tiah a hngaktu a si. Amah cu khonsil sungtel pakhat a si ve naón khonsil thurelnak le thiltuahmi cu a lung a kim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cupa cu Pilat hnenah a feh ih Jesuh ih ruak cu a va dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cule Jesuh ruak cu thinglamtah par ihsin a ṭhum ih puan neemte in a tuam hnuah zohman ih hman hrih lo, lung an khermi thlaan thar sungah a phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cumi cu tlawngkai ni nga ni a si ih Sabbath ni a thok zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galilee ihsin Jesuh a rak thluntu nunau pawl cu Josef an thlun ih thlaanah cun an feh ve. A thlaan le a sungih Jesuh ruak an vui daan khal cu an hmu ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Cule an inn ah an kir ih Jesuh ruak culh dingah rimhmui le zihmui pawl an ngaihtuah. Sabbath ni-ah cun an Daan ih a fial vekin an cawl.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nipi ni zing thlapit ah nunau pawl cu an timtuah ciami rimhmui pawl kengin thlaan ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlankhar lung phengpi a rak ṭhawn aw zo kha an hmu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cu hrangah an vung lut, asinain Bawipa Jesuh ih ruak cu an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An mang a bang ih an ding; culai fangah hmakhatte ah hnipuan tleuzet hrukin mi pahnih an kiangah an rung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ṭih ngaingai ih leilungah an bok; cutikah mi pahnih cun, “Ziangah so a thimi lakah a nungmi cu nan hawl?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinah a um nawn lo; a tho sal zo. Galilee-ih a um laiah nan hnenih a simmi kha nan ciing lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Milai Fapa hi misual pawl kut sungah pek a si ding; thinglamtah parah an khen ding ih ni thum hnuah a tho sal ding,’ a ti kha!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule nunau pawl cun a ṭong kha an vun mang sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thlaan ihsin an kir hnuah dungthluntu hleikhat le midang pawl hnenah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nunau pawl cu Mari Magdalene, Joanna le Jeim ih nu Mari tla an si. Anmah le nunau dang an hnenih a telmi pawl in a dungthluntu pawl kha an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a dungthluntu pawl cun nunau pawl ih simmi cu thulolak ah an ruat ih an zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Piter cu a pok ih thlaanah cun a va tlan. Kuun tahratin a vun bih ih ruak tuamnak puan neemte lawng a hmu; a dang zianghman a hmu lo. Cule cutiih a cangmi cu a mangbang zetin inn ah a tlung sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih ni thotho ah Jesuh a rak thluntu mi pahnih cu Jerusalem ihsin peng sarih hrawng a hlami Emmaus timi khua ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule tubaite ih thil a cangmi pawl cu an ruah aw vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutiin an ṭong ih an relkhawm rero laiah cun Jesuh amah rori in a hun fuuk hai ih an feh tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah cu an hmu naón an thei thiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nan feh phahah ziang thu so nan rel rero?” tiah a sut. Cule an riahsia mithmai thawn an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pakhat pa, Kleopas an timi pa in, “Jerusalem khua a ra tlawngtu mi hmuahhmuah lakah nangmah lawng hi maw tuih ni hnih thum sungah Jerusalem khawsungih thil a cangmi pawl a thei lotu hi na si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih in, “Ziang thil maw?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Nazareth Jesuh parih thil a cangmi pawl!” tiah an let. “Himi pa cu Pathian hmai le misenpi hmaiah zozo khal in profet a si ih a ṭongmi ah siseh, a tuahmi ah siseh, huham a nei ngaingai tiih an ruah ṭhehmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan puithiam upa pawl le in hotu pawl in a thihnak rel dingah mi kut ah an pek ih cuticun thinglamtah parah an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule amah cu Israel mi tlentu a si ding, tiah ruahsannak kan rak neih zetmi a si. Cuih tlunah cubangtuk thil a can hnu tuih ni hi a ni thumnak ni a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kan lakih nunau ṭhenkhat in kan mang in bangter fawn; tuihzing zingthlapit ah thlaan ah an va feh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />asinain a ruak an va hmu lo. An ra kir ih ‘Vancungmi kan hmu ih Anih cu a nungsal zo, tiah in sim,’ tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan lakih mi ṭhenkhat thlaanah an va feh ve ih nunau pawl sim vek cekci in an va hmu ve; asinain amah cu an hmu thotho lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cun an hnenah, “Nannih hi nan va aa so! Profet pawl ih an rak sim ciami nan va zum har lawmmam so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Messiah hrangah hi thil pawl hmuahhmuah hi a tuarta ṭheh hnuah a sunlawinak sungih luh ding cu a ṭul lo maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in Ca Thianghlim sung Moses cauk pawl ihsin thokin profet pawl ih nganmi tiang, amah ih thu an ngannak hmuahhmuah kha an hnenah a simfiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An feh tumnak khua an thlen zik zawng ah Jesuh cu a feh hrih ding vekin a um awter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asinain annih in, “Kan hnenah riak ve ko aw! Khua a tlai zo ih a thim thlang fawn,” tiah an kai. Curuangah an hnen riak dingin a thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An hnenah cun a to ih rawl an hil tlang. Sang a lak ih thla a cam hnuah a phel ih a zem hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah an mit a hung vaang ih Amah a si kha an thei thiam; asinain an mithmuh ah a hlo sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anmah le anmah cu, “Lamzin kan feh tlang laiih kan hnenih a ṭong le Ca Thianghlim a simfiang rero laiah khan kan sungah meisa kang vekin a um tho lo maw kha?” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hmakhatteah Jerusalem ah an kir sal ih dungthlun hleikhat le a dang pawl an rak tonkhawm lai kha an va hmu ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Bawipa cu a tho sal taktak a si! Simon hnenah a lang!” tiih an rak sim awk rero kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Annih pahnih khal in lamzin ih thil a cangmi thu le sang a phel zawng ih Bawipa a si ti an theihthiamnak thu pawl kha an sim ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An pahnih in lamzin ih thil a cangmi pawl thu kha dungthluntu hnenih an rel rero laiah hmakhatte ah an lakah Bawipa cu a rung ding ih, “Nan hnenah daihnak um seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mithla kan hmu tiah an ruat ih an ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain anih in, “Ziangah so nan thin a phan? Ziangah so nan thinlung sungah rinhmainak a um ciamco?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka kut le ka ke tla hi zohhnik uh! Keimah sokhaw ka si! I tham uhla nan thei ding; ziangahtile mithla cun ruh le titsa a nei lo, kei cu ka nei ti in hmu a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutiin a sim ih a kut le a ke tla cu a hmuh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An zum thei thotho lo; an lung a awi tukih an mang tla a bang tuk fawn. Curuangah anmah cu, “Hinah ei ṭha ziangtal nan nei maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Annih in nga pum khat suan cia an pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />a lak ih an hmuh hnganah cun a ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cule an hnenah cun, “Nan hnen ka um laiah ka sim reromi cu hi thil pawl hi sokhaw an si: Moses Daan cabu sung, profet pawl ih nganmi cabu sung le Saam cabu sungih keimah ih thu an rak nganmi pawl cu a kim ṭheh a ṭul a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cun an thinlung mit a vangter ih Ca Thianghlim ih simmi kha an thei thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An hnenah, “An nganmi cu hihi a si: Messiah cu a tuar pei ih a thih hnu ni thumnak ah a tho sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cule Jerusalem ihsin thokin miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah amah hmin ih sualsirnak le sualngaidamnak thuthang cu phuan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nannih cu hi thil cangmi pawl ih thutheitu nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cule ka Pa ih a lo tiam ciami kha keimah rori in nan parah ka run thlah ding. Asinain tlunlam ihsin huham nan hnenih a rung thlen hlanlo khawpi sungin nan hngak pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cun khawpi ihsin a hruai suak hai ih Bethani khua tiang an feh. Cutawkah a ban a pharh ih thlawsuah a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cutiih thlawsuahnak a pek laiah an hnen ihsin a suak ih vancungah a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amah cu an biak ih lungawi zetin Jerusalem ah an kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />An tikcu hmuahhmuah cu Biakinn sungah Pathian thangṭhatnak ah an hmang.
  </para>
</usx>
